&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qridvw&quot; data-start=&quot;3675&quot; data-end=&quot;3744&quot;&gt;Subsidised bus pass from Manchester City Centre to our ICON office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;109gasx&quot; data-start=&quot;3745&quot; data-end=&quot;3786&quot;&gt;Up to 50% staff discount on THG brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19vgosj&quot; data-start=&quot;3787&quot; data-end=&quot;3808&quot;&gt;On-site staff shop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18dj4sf&quot; data-start=&quot;3809&quot; data-end=&quot;3917&quot;&gt;Know someone who would be perfect for THG? Refer them and get up to £1,000 when they pass their probation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a0pci4&quot; data-start=&quot;3918&quot; data-end=&quot;3977&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Anniversary gifts when you hit 5 and 10 years of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
