&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Can Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interesting work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - working in a fast-paced and ever-changing industry, new problems and exciting solutions are never too far away. There are always opportunities to learn new skills and broaden your horizons&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A sense of achievement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Our teams own their own software and when that awesome new feature ships to users and the positive feedback starts rolling in, you can feel really proud of what you and your team created&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - clear and defined career pathways for every role at every level, a supportive manager, loads of learning opportunities and even 10% of your time to dedicate to your learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - everyone at FanDuel works for each other, we win together, make mistakes together and have lots of fun doing it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A trusting work environment where productivity is valued above all else, giving you autonomy and ownership of your time and work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great financial package &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Including salary, bonus, pension, private healthcare, share save scheme, flexible working &amp;amp; holiday policy along with a number of other benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FANDUEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is the premier mobile gaming company in the United States and Canada. FanDuel Group consists of a portfolio of leading brands across mobile wagering including: America’s #1 Sportsbook, FanDuel Sportsbook; its leading iGaming platform, FanDuel Casino; the industry’s unquestioned leader in horse racing and advance-deposit wagering, FanDuel Racing; and its daily fantasy sports product. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, FanDuel Group operates FanDuel TV, its broadly distributed linear cable television network and FanDuel TV+, its leading direct-to-consumer OTT platform. FanDuel Group has a presence across all 50 states, Canada, and Puerto Rico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company is based in New York with US offices in Los Angeles, Atlanta, and Jersey City, as well as global offices in Canada and Scotland. The company’s affiliates have offices worldwide, including in Ireland, Portugal, Romania, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is a subsidiary of Flutter Entertainment, the world&#39;s largest sports betting and gaming operator with a portfolio of globally recognized brands and traded on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: FLUT).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FanDuel is an equal opportunities employer. Diversity and inclusion in FanDuel means that we respect and value everyone as individuals. We don&#39;t tolerate bias, judgement or harassment. Our focus is on developing employees so that they reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FanDuel is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities. If you have a disability and need a workplace accommodation or adjustment during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, please email&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The requirements listed in our job descriptions are guidelines, not hard and fast rules. You don’t have to satisfy every requirement or meet every qualification listed. If your skills are transferable and you are in the ballpark experience-wise, we&#39;d love to speak to you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Karbon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Karbon is the global leader in AI-powered practice management software for accounting firms. We provide an award-winning cloud platform that helps tens of thousands of accounting professionals work more efficiently and collaboratively every day. With customers in 40 countries, we have grown into a globally distributed team across the US, Australia, New Zealand, Canada, the United Kingdom, and the Philippines. We are well-funded, ranked #1 on G2, growing rapidly, and have a people-first culture that is recognized with Great Place To Work® certification and on Fortune magazine&#39;s Best Small Workplaces™ List.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Implementation Specialist at Karbon, you’ll serve as the trusted guide for our largest customers, leading them through onboarding, data migration, implementation, and training. You’ll act as the project manager, consultant, and change management coach, ensuring customers achieve rapid time-to-value and long-term success on the Karbon platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Implementation Specialist, you will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the customer implementation journey&lt;/strong&gt;: Act as the project manager for enterprise accounts, building and maintaining detailed project plans, tracking milestones, and ensuring all deliverables are completed on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate across multiple stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with executive sponsors, firm administrators, and end users to align priorities, clarify responsibilities, and drive accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate structured onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead kickoff meetings, consultative process reviews, configuration workshops, and training sessions tailored to firm needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide professional guidance&lt;/strong&gt;: Advise customers on best practices in workflow design, firm operations, and change management to maximize adoption and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach through change management&lt;/strong&gt;: Help firms prepare their teams for new processes, encouraging adoption and managing resistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure data integrity&lt;/strong&gt;: Support customers in importing contacts and work items, leveraging Excel and other tools to ensure accuracy and completeness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify and mitigate risks&lt;/strong&gt;: Spot early warning signs of delays or adoption issues and proactively intervene to keep projects on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate internally&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with Sales, Customer Success, Product, and Support teams to ensure seamless customer handoffs and capture valuable feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver measurable value&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive outcomes that demonstrate ROI for customers and set them up for long-term success with Karbon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;strong&gt;AI &lt;/strong&gt;in day-to-day implementation work, including ChatGPT licenses and AI-driven workflow automations, to support project planning, customer communications, and process optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3-5+ years of experience in B2B SaaS Implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 2+ years of end-to-end technical implementation experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced in project management and comfortable managing multiple customer projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in customer-facing environments, facilitating workshops and executive-level conversations with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent communication and presentation skills, capable of translating technical concepts into clear, actionable steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are consultative by nature, with the humility to listen and the confidence to challenge firms to rethink their processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong attention to detail and pride yourself on accuracy and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy working with data and systems, ensuring integrity throughout migrations and configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are resilient and adaptable, thriving in dynamic environments where change is constant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working remotely and managing your time independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the accounting or tax industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience with workflow, accounting, or project management software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in software onboarding or enterprise implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of change management frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a startup or high-growth SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge and hands-on experience using Karbon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work at Karbon?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain global experience across the USA, Australia, New Zealand, UK, Canada and the Philippines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter &amp;amp; work from home benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office equipment menu for you to choose how you deck out your home office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultural and offsite events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance based and globally benchmarked pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 10 wellness days (because you don&#39;t need to be &quot;sick&quot; to stay well)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Karbon Fun / Social Club!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 5 weeks paid vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with (and learn from) an experienced, high-performing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, team-oriented culture that embraces diversity, invests in development and provides consistent feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a fast-growing company that firmly believes in promoting high performers from within
&lt;p class=&quot;body&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;body&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As we hire across various locations within the USA we are required by law to include a reasonable estimate of the compensation range for this role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The range provided is broad and takes into consideration a wide range of factors that are reviewed when making a hiring decision, such as physical location/cost of living in that location, years of experience, skills, and other business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is not typical for a candidate to be hired at or near the top of the pay range and each compensation decision is dependent on each individual case. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary is one component of the total compensation package, which for some roles may include a target bonus, for some roles very competitive equity grant, and very generous benefits. While we believe competitive compensation is a critical aspect of you deciding to join us, we do hope you also spend time considering why our mission, purpose and values are right for you. We are creating something transformational here, and we hope you are as excited about the future as we are!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base salary range for this role is: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£64,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£70,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-type=&quot;unstyled&quot; data-id=&quot;37024650-610f-4dfe-8f74-6e5b0feb927b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please be aware that Karbon will only contact you via email from our domain, karbonhq.com. If you receive an email from any other domain, please do not click any of those links.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-type=&quot;unstyled&quot; data-id=&quot;37024650-610f-4dfe-8f74-6e5b0feb927b&quot;&gt;Karbon embraces diversity and inclusion, aligning with our values as a business. Research has shown that women and underrepresented groups are less likely to apply to jobs unless they meet every single criteria. If you&#39;ve made it this far in the job description but your past experience doesn&#39;t perfectly align, we do encourage you to still apply. You could still be the right person for the role!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-type=&quot;unstyled&quot; data-id=&quot;5f9e3aa2-2690-4788-af20-892dbdba6ed2&quot;&gt;We recruit and reward people based on capability and performance. We don’t discriminate based on race, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, lifestyle, age, educational background, national origin, religion, physical or cognitive ability, and other diversity dimensions that may hinder inclusion in the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-type=&quot;unstyled&quot; data-id=&quot;bb4a5afa-071e-49bd-9510-b951e1f125de&quot;&gt;Generally, if you are a good person, we want to talk to you. &lt;span data-type=&quot;EMOJI&quot; data-emoji-colon=&quot;stuck_out_tongue&quot; data-emoji-id=&quot;😛&quot; data-id=&quot;97488c7e-05ea-4a57-8774-fd75a6a1882c&quot;&gt;😛&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-type=&quot;unstyled&quot; data-id=&quot;a6b8c301-2390-453b-a5eb-e526a94dca3c&quot;&gt;If there are any adjustments or accommodations that we can make to assist you during the recruitment process, and your journey at Karbon, contact us at ----- for a confidential discussion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-type=&quot;unstyled&quot; data-id=&quot;a6b8c301-2390-453b-a5eb-e526a94dca3c&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-type=&quot;unstyled&quot; data-id=&quot;a6b8c301-2390-453b-a5eb-e526a94dca3c&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(42, 46, 69); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;At this time, we request that agency referrals are not submitted for this position. We appreciate your understanding and encourage direct applications from interested candidates. Thank you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, B2B Platform Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Belfast, NI / Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(This role requires working in-office 3 days per week.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote is a leading AI-powered growth solutions partner for regulated property and casualty insurance entities, enabling the largest insurance carriers and thousands of agents to maximize customer acquisition across digital channels. Fueled by our proprietary data assets and our AI traffic engine, EverQuote is transforming the way providers attract and engage consumers to grow market share.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our team puts you at the forefront of this transformation. You will collaborate with a group of builders to solve complex problems and reshape a massive industry. If you want to drive real-world impact and do the best work of your career, you’ve found your home. We move fast, follow the data, and hold ourselves to high standards. If that&#39;s how you work too, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a senior member of the engineering team you will be instrumental in planning, designing, and implementing applications that will scale with EverQuote systems. &lt;br&gt;
In this role, you will build applications and services that meet the needs of the business while also being scalable, performant and easy to maintain. This is a full-stack role with a &lt;br&gt;backend focus, where you will be expected to take full ownership of large pieces of business critical functionality. 
You will be joining a team of talented, collaborative engineers eager to grow and deliver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and delivery of key business applications and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance code quality, productivity and velocity through the use of AI assisted technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to our Software Development processes whilst improving our Engineering culture by identifying and addressing inefficiencies in our processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage with cross functional stakeholders including Product Managers and Architecture team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional programming experience including experience at a software product company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one or more of the following languages Typescript, Golang, Python or other server side languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked in a microservice-based architecture and are proficient in Docker and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, deploying and monitoring cloud based applications, systems &amp;amp; infrastructure at scale (ideally on AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience designing systems and communicating designs to technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about sharing knowledge and mentoring teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to quickly diagnose and solve code problems, as well as help others unblock themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an entrepreneurial mindset, want to grow a business, and love working with a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable using data to support and validate your concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a fast-paced work environment where everyday contributions have a big impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in variable cash bonus programs, equity, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility which are designated by role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your role during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statement on Fair Employment and Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI is committed to ensuring equal opportunity for all job applicants and employees. We will not discriminate on the grounds of religious belief, political opinion, race, gender (including gender reassignment), sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, pregnancy or maternity, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a registered employer in Northern Ireland, EverQuote NI complies with the Fair Employment and Treatment (Northern Ireland) Order 1998. As part of the application process, you will be asked to complete a fair employment monitoring form; this information is used solely for monitoring purposes and does not form part of the shortlisting or selection decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI carries out background checks on all candidates offered a position. A criminal record will not automatically disqualify you from working with EverQuote NI Limited; each case is considered on its individual merits in line with our fair recruitment practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Adjustments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to ensuring an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any reasonable adjustments or accommodations at any stage of the interview process, please let us know and we will work with you to arrange them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=6XmzUHfuQ-i5S31_qCIpcQCQtcZ6e1ZCg-K9ZDUrOSjhU2y_ydujWqUSk1qbf0g08qVEJgBQCRrYN_rQ6s8R1bQPdaN9iF-VnAt04umDr2dE8nvrwxpZdkrAXEGT1B1W&quot;&gt;https://investors.everquote.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=77BAgL1nVeMykQsQieJyMOhYF-A1vLMHTvEuCfBOEZ3y8__JO9djvQmh39yBJX6yJu8z7nHYbHDvvyVkE2tBDSmNhEC7b1rXdBhuOD6_EEW4-W-Bal3QIK35pntX1W7wpCEWJkz5Ouui49uO507CTSlujcntR_vtPWE-rgBZ5E-p2PqAuo57e5Qv4Tv6QhC-n6qQjfy6QyTWRFcSaZnBetOgWYZADxcw-o4FsA_59RFz1Jt7fklOmQ8TWFMdjowUuoeYy-eog8rwjsES_lJwEPPqVjfaCHv76iX7KX3pOhGVuO1kDfKFQNaGgpnnqIY3W8mYzPeMJEisnZ6PgV4sgO1EVe7cY0cS8JDoOc9JMsBma3kScg5NSRPdt1ZNQvAnsjfWLaj8Q0Xmg9vqEkXqhvPvYuXbpSBpuADuxOKh8Yn2rAJzPdDDRbBgVEuYzlbVwrHM27mDXBGESKq_dfkYajMWrNGjbF3dg4omuuCvDpneGp3mrnk6IMTmwiogaLCXrp6dHSw_rVHsXixipTUhAXy7Gd_5_zeuDewZ1X_4gSV-f-fuipPZ42u2YD6RiUF-mP4WAjF7yUJkbh0nMJjY0g==&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At NaturalMotion, we make games that wow people. We innovate to create previously impossible experiences that would not exist without us. We take pride in making titles that reach a large audience and creating communities that last. &lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(38, 38, 38)&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;white&quot;&gt;Our commitment to excellence has earned us recognition as one of the UK&#39;s Best Places to Work in games for eight consecutive years by&amp;nbsp;gamesindustry.biz, and we&#39;re proud to be part of the Zynga and Take-Two Interactive family.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Server &amp;amp; Infrastructure Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join our server engineering team. In this role, you will work on core backend systems and backend services, contributing directly to live services and build systems with minimal supervision. You will help manage and expand our infrastructure, automated CI/CD pipelines, and development tools while collaborating closely with technical leads to build reliable, high-performing server environments. You will have a passion for large-scale high-availability systems, a devotion to software craftsmanship, an unwavering commitment to quality, and the desire to have their work seen by tens of millions of people worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Server &amp;amp; Infrastructure Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Complete multi-day backend engineering tasks with minimal guidance. Design, deploy, and support scalable server architectures and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; Pipeline Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and optimise robust CI/CD workflows and automated deployment pipelines across cloud environments and build platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in technical planning, architectural brainstorming, and technical cost/complexity estimation for multi-week efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Efficiency &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify workflow bottlenecks and drive initiatives to improve overall engineering team productivity, tooling, and code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in internal tech talks, share best practices, and maintain collaborative peer relationships across engineering squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Python, Go and C#&lt;/strong&gt; for backend services, automation scripts, and custom tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Infrastructure &amp;amp; IaC:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience provisioning and managing &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt; infrastructure using &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; (Infrastructure as Code).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Platform Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience configuring and managing automated orchestration/build platforms (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Unreal Horde&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Jenkins&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;TeamCity&lt;/strong&gt;), preferably with &lt;strong&gt;Game Engines (Unreal Engine, Unity, etc.)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source Control Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong working knowledge of version control systems and workflow strategies (&lt;strong&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Perforce/Helix Core&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Git-flow&lt;/strong&gt;, branch management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage moderate-to-complex technical tasks independently, break down project deliverables, and communicate status accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing server-side logic and managing database dependencies for live applications or multiplayer services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in, or has a strong interest in the gaming industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in infrastructure deployment and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in mentoring junior team members or interns, framing task deconstruction, and conducting technical interviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containerisation (&lt;strong&gt;Docker, Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;) and infrastructure security best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain). &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At NaturalMotion, we make games that wow people. We innovate to create previously impossible experiences that would not exist without us. We take pride in making titles that reach a large audience and creating communities that last. &lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(38, 38, 38)&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;white&quot;&gt;Our commitment to excellence has earned us recognition as one of the UK&#39;s Best Places to Work in games for eight consecutive years by&amp;nbsp;gamesindustry.biz, and we&#39;re proud to be part of the Zynga and Take-Two Interactive family.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Technical Animator to join our team in supporting our next unannounced project. You will work alongside the Animation Team helping to deliver and bring to life our amazing characters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role, you would work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for creating and maintaining the rigging and technical animation pipeline for the projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As part of the Animation Team, you will play a key role in implementing characters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting to the Lead Animator and Art Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate expert knowledge of the skeletal pipeline from Rigging to exporting finalised characters into game, with a speciality of understanding mobile limitations (both bipedal and non-bipedal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in how animation systems work in Unreal Engine, debug, modify and being able to create them in game engines from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have expert knowledge of retargeting and shared skeleton pipeline, both in and out of engine and can expand into retargeting between non matching skeletons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the setup of cloth sim and dynamics in both Engine and 3D software, the application of such and the requirements and limitations of its use on mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in 3D software relevant scripting languages; MEL, Python, Max Script, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational knowledge of rigging; using bones, IK, Splines, Blend Shapes, Skinning, node editing and setting up animation blueprints in Unreal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have advanced knowledge of major third party rigging systems used in the industry; Advanced Skeleton, Rapid Rig, mGear etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in animation systems that are scalable and able to work on a wide range of mobile devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete ownership of pipeline with good documentation and communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Premium character presentation pipelines - build and own animation systems for high-value front-end moments, ensuring characters are always presented at a premium quality bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated optimization techniques for the creation of LODs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support a fast paced character pipeline in the delivery of characters per season.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to demonstrate knowledge of Facial Rigging processes, game engine compatible solutions and how to implement them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with motion capture, cleanup and application to different characters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of procedural animation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in other areas of technical art e.g. Shaders, Lighting Tech, VFX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain). &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous transformons la façon dont le monde mange et fait ses courses en rendant leur accès plus pratique et agréable. Nous connectons les consommateurs, les restaurants, les magasins et les cyclistes. Nous donnons à chaque personne la possibilité d&#39;acheter ce qu&#39;elle veut, comme elle le veut, quand elle le veut et où elle le veut.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes une entreprise axée sur la technologie, à l&#39;avant-garde d&#39;un secteur qui connaît une des expansions les plus rapides au monde. Nous avançons rapidement, valorisons l&#39;autonomie, et sommes toujours en recherche de nouvelles idées et de personnes talentueuses pour nous rejoindre !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu&#39;Account Manager (H/F) basé(e) à Montpellier en télétravail, vous serez responsable du succès de votre portefeuille de comptes stratégiques sur la ville de Montpellier et sa métropole, afin de mettre en place les outils les plus pertinents pour nos utilisateurs. Vous reporterez directement au City Manager Lead en place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos principales missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer un portefeuille de restaurants clés à Montpellier et dans sa métropole, nécessitant une réelle expertise et une attention particulière.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer un partenariat privilégié et durable en apportant votre expertise Food Tech, en tant qu&#39;expert(e) de votre zone/ville.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimiser la rentabilité de votre portefeuille et proposer un accompagnement personnalisé, construit sur le long terme avec l&#39;appui de la data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser la performance de votre portefeuille et prendre les mesures adéquates. Faire des recommandations directes au City Manager Lead, faire preuve d&#39;agilité et d&#39;ouverture à la nouveauté. Deliveroo est une entreprise en mouvement, avec des outils et options à déployer à un rythme soutenu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggérer et mettre en œuvre des campagnes marketing et promotionnelles adaptées à votre portefeuille.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre de près les opérations pour optimiser l&#39;expérience à la fois des restaurants partenaires et des clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous déplacer régulièrement chez vos partenaires à Montpellier pour entretenir la proximité et la relation de confiance, tout en travaillant à distance au quotidien avec vos équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre expérience et vos qualités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 à 3 ans d&#39;expérience minimum sur un poste similaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à négocier, anticiper des discussions commerciales et entreprendre les actions nécessaires pour maintenir un portefeuille de qualité (discussions contractuelles, négociation d&#39;outils commerciaux, etc.) et atteindre les objectifs (OKRs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à garder le contrôle de son portefeuille Partenaires, à observer les tendances du marché local et à fournir des retours en temps réel à ses partenaires et à son manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise terrain : proche de vos partenaires, vous assurez une veille concurrentielle qualitative sur votre portefeuille et le marché montpelliérain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à convaincre et à influencer vos partenaires pour atteindre les objectifs fixés, tout en respectant les valeurs de Deliveroo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactivité et capacité à tirer des conclusions des résultats de vos actions pour faire des recommandations pertinentes à votre City Manager Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compréhension et appropriation rapides des objectifs à atteindre, avec autonomie et détermination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à mettre en place des actions personnalisées et cohérentes avec les besoins des partenaires et les directives managériales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous transformons la façon dont le monde mange et fait ses courses en rendant leur accès plus pratique et agréable. Nous connectons les consommateurs, les restaurants, les magasins et les cyclistes. Nous donnons à chaque personne la possibilité d&#39;acheter ce qu&#39;elles veulent, comme elles le veulent, quand elles le veulent et où elles le veulent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes une entreprise axée sur la technologie, à l&#39;avant-garde d’un secteur qui connaît une des expansions les plus rapides au monde. Nous avançons rapidement, valorisons l&#39;autonomie, et sommes toujours en recherche de nouvelles idées et de personnes talentueuses pour nous rejoindre!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes principales missions :&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer un &lt;strong&gt;portefeuille de restaurants clés&lt;/strong&gt; sur des zones matures, où l’expertise et l’attention au détail font toute la différence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer des &lt;strong&gt;partenariats privilégiés et durables&lt;/strong&gt; en devenant le point de contact expert de votre zone et en mettant à profit vos connaissances Food Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimiser la performance&lt;/strong&gt; de vos comptes grâce à un accompagnement personnalisé, construit sur le long terme et nourri par la data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les résultats de vos restaurants, identifier les leviers d’amélioration et &lt;strong&gt;recommander des actions concrètes&lt;/strong&gt; à votre manager tout en restant agile et ouvert à la nouveauté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proposer et mettre en place des &lt;strong&gt;campagnes marketing et promotionnelles&lt;/strong&gt; ciblées pour booster l’attractivité de vos restaurants partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre de près le déroulé des opérations afin de garantir la meilleure &lt;strong&gt;expérience restaurant&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;client&lt;/strong&gt; possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton expérience et tes qualités :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as déjà &lt;strong&gt;2 à 3 ans d’expérience&lt;/strong&gt; sur un rôle similaire où la gestion d’un portefeuille de partenaires était centrale à ta mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais &lt;strong&gt;négocier&lt;/strong&gt; et anticiper les discussions commerciales tout en gardant à l’esprit les valeurs de Deliveroo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais garder le &lt;strong&gt;contrôle de ton portefeuille&lt;/strong&gt;, identifier les nouvelles tendances du marché et partager du feedback utile à tes partenaires ainsi qu’à ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le &lt;strong&gt;terrain&lt;/strong&gt; est un lieu où tu te sens à ta place : tu sais construire des relations de confiance avec tes partenaires tout en gardant un œil attentif sur la concurrence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais te montrer &lt;strong&gt;proactif&lt;/strong&gt;, analyser les résultats de tes actions et proposer des recommandations concrètes à ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu travailles de manière &lt;strong&gt;autonome&lt;/strong&gt; tout en gardant le cap fixé, sais t’approprier des objectifs précis et mets tout en œuvre pour les atteindre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais concevoir des &lt;strong&gt;actions spécifiques&lt;/strong&gt;, adaptées à la fois aux besoins de tes partenaires et à la stratégie définie par ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais identifier, comprendre et analyser les &lt;strong&gt;données de performance&lt;/strong&gt; (commerciales et opérationnelles) pour garantir un niveau de service irréprochable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais &lt;strong&gt;t’exprimer en anglais&lt;/strong&gt; (à l’oral comme à l’écrit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu arrives à convaincre tout en construisant des relations commerciales solides, durables, où Deliveroo devient le partenaire de choix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Et si tu cherches un poste où tu travailles en &lt;strong&gt;full remote depuis Lille&lt;/strong&gt;, tout en gardant un lien fort avec le terrain et les équipes, alors c’est peut‑être le rôle qu’il te faut !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe est en forte croissance, notre impact très important, et nous cherchons à répondre aux questions les plus stimulantes du moment. Nous progressons rapidement, nous explorons toujours de nouvelles idées et nous sommes très transparents quant aux décisions que nous prenons et à ce qui motive nos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il y a tellement de questions que nous souhaitons résoudre, et encore plus que nous n&#39;avons pas encore rencontrées. Comment les données et la technologie peuvent-elles aider les restaurants à développer leur activité à mesure que les habitudes des consommateurs évoluent ? Comment pouvons-nous prédire ce qu&#39;une personne souhaitera pour dîner avant même que l&#39;idée ne lui vienne à l&#39;esprit ? Chez Deliveroo, ces questions ne sont que quelques-uns des défis ambitieux auxquels nous nous efforçons de répondre – et il n&#39;y a aucun projet qui ne peut pas devenir le vôtre. Aucune solution n&#39;appartient à une équipe en particulier, ce qui vous ouvre d&#39;extraordinaires possibilités en termes de développement et d&#39;impact personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages et diversité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo France valorise la diversité sans discrimination de genre, race, sexualité, religion ou préférences personnelles. Avec un score de 99/100 à l&#39;Indice de l&#39;Égalité Hommes-Femmes 2023, nous sommes engagés envers l&#39;égalité des chances. Rejoignez-nous avec votre passion pour la nourriture dans une entreprise en pleine croissance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco France recherche un·e&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;PDLC/SDLC Expert – Python &amp;amp; GenAI&lt;/strong&gt; pour accompagner les acteurs majeurs de la banque et des services financiers dans l&#39;optimisation et la transformation de leurs cycles de développement produit et logiciel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de notre Practice Technology &amp;amp; Engineering, vous interviendrez à l’intersection du Software Engineering, de l’automatisation et de l’intelligence artificielle pour concevoir et déployer des solutions améliorant la qualité, la rapidité et la fiabilité du développement logiciel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous travaillerez aux côtés des équipes Engineering, Architecture, DevOps et Product pour analyser les pratiques existantes, identifier les opportunités d’amélioration et accompagner l’évolution des méthodes de développement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous jouerez un rôle clé dans l’intégration de la GenAI et des workflows AI-enabled au sein des cycles PDLC/SDLC, de la conception à la mise en production, en veillant à maintenir la supervision humaine, la sécurité, la traçabilité et les standards de qualité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyser et optimiser les cycles Product Development Lifecycle (PDLC) et Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) afin d’améliorer la qualité, la productivité et la fiabilité des processus de développement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Concevoir et développer des solutions et outils d’automatisation en Python, notamment pour les activités de développement, de tests, de validation et de maintenance logicielle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer des capacités de GenAI et des workflows AI-enabled dans les pratiques d’ingénierie, notamment pour l’assistance au développement, la génération et la revue de code, la documentation et l’automatisation des tests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborer avec les équipes Engineering, DevOps, Architecture et Product pour industrialiser les solutions, renforcer les pratiques CI/CD et accompagner leur adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Évaluer l’efficacité des solutions déployées et garantir une utilisation responsable de l’IA, avec des mécanismes de contrôle, de validation humaine, de traçabilité et d’escalade adaptés aux environnements réglementés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre profil :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience significative en Software Engineering, avec une expertise confirmée en Python et une bonne compréhension des architectures et pratiques de développement logiciel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une solide connaissance des cycles PDLC/SDLC, des méthodologies Agile, des pratiques DevOps, CI/CD et des principes de qualité logicielle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience pratique de l’utilisation de la GenAI dans le développement logiciel, notamment des assistants de programmation, des LLMs ou des outils d’automatisation des workflows d’ingénierie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une capacité à analyser des processus complexes, identifier des leviers d’optimisation et concevoir des solutions techniques adaptées aux besoins des équipes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une approche collaborative permettant de travailler avec des équipes techniques et métiers, associée à une compréhension des enjeux de sécurité, de gouvernance et de Responsible AI. Vous êtes à l’aise pour travailler en français et en anglais dans des environnements internationaux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience de mise en œuvre de solutions AI-assisted Software Development, notamment pour la génération de code, les tests automatisés ou l&#39;amélioration des pratiques DevSecOps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience dans la banque, les marchés de capitaux, l&#39;assurance ou d&#39;autres environnements financiers réglementés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi rejoindre Capco?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco est un cabinet de conseil international, spécialisé dans les services financiers.&lt;br&gt;Fondé en 1998, le cabinet compte aujourd’hui plus de 7 000 collaborateurs dans 36 bureaux à travers le monde, dont 160 à Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenger reconnu face aux grands noms du conseil, Capco se distingue par sa double expertise métier et technologique, au service de la stratégie comme de l’exécution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre promesse : accompagner la transformation de nos clients dans un monde en constante mutation – réglementaire, technologique et opérationnel.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous intervenons à l’intersection du business, de la réglementation et de la tech, en mobilisant des équipes pluridisciplinaires, expérimentées et engagées.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos marqueurs distinctifs :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une spécialisation sectorielle forte&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nous apportons à nos clients une compréhension approfondie de leurs enjeux métiers, en particulier dans la banque, les marchés de capitaux et l’énergie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une approche collaborative et sur mesure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nous intégrons les équipes clients, adaptons nos méthodes à leur culture et co-construisons des solutions concrètes et opérationnelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L’excellence comme exigence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notre ambition est d’obtenir des résultats mesurables et durables pour nos clients – et de toujours viser la valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un esprit “One Capco”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nos équipes collaborent à l’échelle internationale pour mobiliser les meilleures expertises et partager les bonnes pratiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une culture entrepreneuriale et inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;L’innovation, l’initiative et le mérite sont au cœur de notre modèle. Nous valorisons les idées, la diversité et le progrès collectif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos expertises s’articulent autour de 6 métiers complémentaires&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stratégie &amp;amp; Transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance, Risque &amp;amp; Conformité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product, Innovation &amp;amp; Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseil Tech (Advisory)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering (Delivery)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chez Capco, nous vous offrons&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement de travail international centré sur l’innovation et la création de valeur pour nos clients bancaires et assuranciels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un parcours de formation continu adapté à vos besoins, pour acquérir de nouvelles compétences et développer une réelle expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une organisation de travail hybride (charte télétravail de 2 jours par semaine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une rémunération compétitive avec un bonus lié à la performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un PEE avec un abondement de 2903€ par an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture d’entreprise entrepreneuriale, inclusive et méritocratique, de nouveau certifiée Great Place To Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des initiatives pour construire le Capco de demain&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Woman@capco&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSE (forfait mobilité durable, jour de solidarité, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des communautés métiers, sportives et culturelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Capco Paris, handicap visible ou invisible, parcours atypique ou classique, toutes les candidatures sont les bienvenues et seront traitées avec équité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure, Inc. (formerly Pure Storage) is adding a Systems (Presales) Engineer to our Commercial district in France, covering the PACA region from Marseille or Aix-en-Provence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a field presales role for someone with 5+ years of hands-on SE experience who enjoys owning a territory. You will partner with several Account Executives across a mixed portfolio: large regional accounts where you drive the technical agenda, public-sector organizations in health, social services and heavy industry, and a long tail of mid-sized companies where speed and pragmatism win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical relationship across your territory: discovery, architecture, demos, proofs of concept and technical closure, on Everpure&#39;s Enterprise Data Cloud platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take the initiative in large accounts: build activity, find new use cases, and create opportunities rather than wait for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell outcomes, not boxes: position services and consumption models (Evergreen//One, storage-as-a-service) credibly with IT and finance stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work day to day with your Account Executives and with channel partners in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical responses to RFPs and RFIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a national SE team that shares knowledge and wins across districts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING – REQUIRED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a field presales / Systems Engineer / Solutions Engineer role, ideally with a territory or multi-account scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid general infrastructure culture: compute, virtualisation, networking, data protection, and how they fit together in real customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling services, subscription or consumption models: you can explain the commercial side as well as the technical one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A senior, autonomous way of working: you take initiative, drive activity in large accounts, and manage your own agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity: you learn new technology quickly and like finding new use cases for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in or near Marseille / Aix-en-Provence, with a driving licence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and professional English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise storage experience (SAN, NAS, object, data protection). Valuable, not required: a dedicated onboarding quarter covers it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at an infrastructure, data-protection or open-source vendor, or at a services company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with IT teams in the PACA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LOCATION &amp;amp; TRAVEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home-based in the Marseille / Aix-en-Provence area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expect to be with customers around half your time or more. Travel is regional, so you are home in the evening, with occasional trips to Paris for team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe Digital Repair recherche un·e &lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; (f/m/d) en CDI basé·e à Lille (Campus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L&#39;équipe Digital Repair a pour mission de prolonger la durée de vie de nos produits sportifs grâce à des solutions numériques innovantes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Composée de profils variés et passionnés (développeurs, product managers, designers), notre équipe relève le défi de l&#39;économie circulaire chez Decathlon.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;En nous rejoignant, tu auras un impact direct sur la réduction de notre empreinte écologique tout en offrant une expérience de réparation fluide, fiable et accessible à nos utilisateurs à travers le monde.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;En tant que Quality Engineer (f/m/d), tu seras le/la garant·e de la qualité des produits que nous mettons à disposition de nos utilisateurs. Tes missions principales seront :&lt;br&gt;* Accompagner les équipes de développement dans la mise en place et le maintien de l&#39;automatisation des tests.&lt;br&gt;* Proposer et ajouter de nouvelles méthodes de test pour toujours garantir un plus haut niveau de qualité tout en réduisant les temps de delivery.&lt;br&gt;* Diffuser la culture de la qualité au sein de l&#39;équipe et collaborer étroitement avec les développeurs dès la phase de conception.&lt;br&gt;* Suivre les indicateurs de qualité et assurer la fiabilité globale de nos parcours utilisateurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Tu as une expérience solide et confirmée en test d&#39;applications Web et de micro-services.&lt;br&gt;* Tu maîtrises l&#39;usage de l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle (IA) appliquée au métier de la QA pour optimiser et innover dans tes méthodes de test.&lt;br&gt;* Tu es reconnu·e pour ton esprit de synthèse, ta rigueur et ta capacité à évangéliser les bonnes pratiques de qualité.&lt;br&gt;* Tu sais t&#39;intégrer et collaborer efficacement dans un environnement agile.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;* Automatisation et tests : Playwright, JEST, Karate&lt;br&gt;* Suivi et gestion : JIRA&lt;br&gt;* Intégration continue (CI) : GitHub Actions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;br&gt;* Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;br&gt;* Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;br&gt;* Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;br&gt;* Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager - Categories (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; E-Commerce Solutions — Navigate &amp;amp; Categories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT DECATHLON &amp;amp; THE E-COMMERCE DOMAIN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon is accelerating its digital transformation with the mission of becoming &lt;strong&gt;the sports digital platform&lt;/strong&gt; that allows customers to discover our universe through local, sport-centered, and omnichannel experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining this scope, you will work within the &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Solutions&lt;/strong&gt; domain. Our teams build and transform the global e-commerce navigation, catalog treeviews, and backend categorization engines aiming to allows users to effortlessly discover and access Decathlon’s complete offering of products, services, and information&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOIN THE CATEGORIES SQUAD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;Group Product Manager (E-Commerce / Navigate)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will take ownership of the &lt;strong&gt;Categories&lt;/strong&gt; squad. You will work alongside a dedicated engineering squad (Tech Lead, Senior Software Engineers), and collaborate closely with UX Researchers, Product Designers, Data Analysts, Sports Digital Merchandisers, and local Country E-Commerce teams).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Empowering discovery through intelligent, scalable navigation. We build an intuitive, automated, and personalized browsing journey so every customer finds what they need, want, and desire faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive global conversion and incremental revenue by transforming fragmented local treeviews into a unified, high-performing Core Navigation across web and mobile platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the product vision, strategy, and roadmap for the &lt;strong&gt;Categories &amp;amp; Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and arbitrate key product streams across &lt;strong&gt;Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; (standardizing category trees globally) and &lt;strong&gt;SKU-Level Categorization Engines&lt;/strong&gt; (such as our streaming engine &lt;em&gt;Tesseract&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align stakeholders across central sports teams, global digital merchandising, and local country teams around shared treeview operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously identify user, SEO, and market opportunities through data analysis, user testing, and card-sorting studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a continuous and consistent A/B testing process to refine business convictions and identify top growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance global standardization with local market flexibility, ensuring smooth migration from local catalog treeviews to global &lt;strong&gt;Core Trees&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear decision-making frameworks and SLAs for global taxonomy, SEO content guidance, and category creation governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead agile product delivery in close partnership with the Engineering Lead and squad members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize and mature the team’s backlog (epics, user stories) to support multi-level export feed pipelines, batch orchestration tooling, and taxonomy rules execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee key migration milestones for countries adopting the Core Navigation framework across desktop and mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success metrics across navigation channels, including &lt;strong&gt;PDP Reach Rate, Revenue per Session, Menu Usage CTR&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Category-Level Conversion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data analytics to streamline category performance, eliminating inactive categories and optimizing taxonomy filters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbitrate and prioritize backlog based on data driven decision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Mindset &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an ambassador for product excellence and taxonomy standards across Decathlon’s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative work environment based on trust, accountability, and user-centric decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFILE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience as a Product Manager in a fast-paced B2C e-commerce, digital platform, or catalog/search ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of e-commerce navigation, catalog treeviews, taxonomy/metadata structures, or search &amp;amp; discovery platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to navigate complex, multi-stakeholder international organizations (aligning global tech teams, business merchandisers, and country leads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of end-to-end product development—from discovery (UX research, data analysis, A/B testing) to delivery (backlog refinement, technical roadmapping, release planning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Data-driven approach to prioritizing product features and measuring conversion and user experience impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English and French (written and spoken), with excellent synthesis skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; Curiosity for solving scalable architecture/data problems, user-centric design, and a strong passion for sports!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 days of remote work per week (flexible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based at our Decathlon Technology office in Paris, France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choice of Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on your preferred device (Mac, Windows, Chromebook).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; High-impact role at the heart of Decathlon&#39;s global e-commerce engine, offering mentorship, certifications, and international growth paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Employee shareholding opportunities, along with monthly and quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The SMB New Business Account Executive role is a critical role in building GitLab’s customer-base and continued long-term growth. The SMB New Business Account Executive will focus exclusively on acquiring new customers and generating new logos by executing on an inbound/outbound sales playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will own a territory and book of prospect accounts (including free GitLab users, trials, engaged leads and cold prospects). You will navigate it by leveraging data, developing a deep understanding of the product, the market, customer challenges and business needs. You will strategically build relationships with your accounts and lead a consultative sales cycle by painting the vision of DevSecOps with GitLab and helping them achieve business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role for someone who is competitive, self-starter and hungry, who is excited by forming new motions, thrives in a hunter environment and is energized by building relationships and business cases from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive selling into free users and base prospects within the SMB segment by articulating the value of GitLab. Engaging with inbound prospect and proactively reaching out to prospects showing potential and key signals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, co-create and consistently iterate on the outbound / new logo playbook and strategy to win new customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce and execute against new creative prospecting and campaign ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of and act as the CEO for the book of business in your territory:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document the buying criteria &amp;amp; process, next steps &amp;amp; owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute comprehensive prospecting strategies to build and maintain a healthy pipeline of new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work and collaborate with our Partner ecosystem to drive new business and value for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize business and industry knowledge to research accounts, identify key players, generate interest, create/identify compelling events, and develop accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle from initial contact to close by involving technical audience, multiple stakeholders and decision-makers, and articulating GitLab’s value proposition to across various industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master MEDPICC and Command of the Message on all opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams including Sales Development, Solution Architecture and Digital Marketing to develop winning strategies in targeting accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to root cause analyses on wins/losses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate lessons learned to the team, including the marketing team, the technical team and product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback: Effectively communicate learnings, feedback and challenges to relevant teams (including Product Development, Sales, and Marketing) to drive continuous improvement, and be the voice of the prospect by contributing product ideas to our public issue tracker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documenting improvements in our sales handbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market knowledge: Maintain a foundational understanding of technologies related to GitLab’s market focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training &amp;amp; Certifications: Acquire industry standard certifications to build up credibility as a technical expert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieving monthly and quarterly new logo acquisition targets, for both new logo count and booked ARR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share our values, and work in accordance with those values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter with a proven track record of resilience, motivation and results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of outbound sales activity, securing calls, meeting and winning business, with a creative ability to break into new accounts and build business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator, strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent discovery skills, ability to uncover and address customer pain points, negotiation, presentation and closing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated progressive experience in sales, technical consulting, customer success, marketing, or customer service in the field of information technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of B2B software, Open Source software, and the developer product space is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern sales tech stack including Salesforce, Clari, Outreach, ZoomInfo/Cognism, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Gong, and 6sense&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of application lifecycle management including the technology commonly used in application lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be ready to learn how to use GitLab and Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focuses on continuously improving your professional skills with a focus on personal mastery and team learning through activities such as training, reading and seeking mentorship from others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in another language ie. French, German, Spanish, Dutch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel if needed and comply with the company’s travel policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To view the full job description and its compensation calculator, view our handbook. The compensation calculator can be found towards the bottom of the page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional details about our process can be found on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hiring page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_actions__container c-message__actions&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: xx-small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;Remote-Global&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
