&lt;h1&gt;Performance Marketing Working Student – Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Working student, 20 hours/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take a look at where you&#39;ll be based: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot;&gt;watch the Berlin office tour&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Team description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition&#39;s Performance Marketing function helps attract the right candidates efficiently across different markets and roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to strengthen our in-house capabilities, you&#39;ll support day-to-day campaign operations, reporting and continuous improvement. You&#39;ll work closely with teams across Talent Acquisition and Employer branding, gaining hands-on experience in how data, digital marketing and operational processes support hiring at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day monitoring of paid recruitment marketing campaigns and flag anything that needs attention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep job listings live, accurate and correctly categorised across active boards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support weekly performance reporting across impressions, clicks, applications, cost per application and candidate pipeline contribution, and flag unusual performance or budget pacing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate creative feedback between the TA team, Employer Brand and external agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research markets, audiences and competitors to help sharpen the marketing approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve recurring workflows and identify opportunities to make processes more efficient and support recurring operational tasks across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying Marketing, Digital Marketing, Communications, Media, Business, Data Analytics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some hands-on exposure to marketing, recruitment, creative content or communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with spreadsheets and interpreting basic campaign metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re detail-oriented, organised and comfortable taking ownership of recurring tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in digital marketing, data and how processes can be improved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp 🎉&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office at Ostbahnhof&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Be part of an inclusive and collaborative environment where different perspectives are valued&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days, pro-rated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Access health and well-being support through our Employee Assistance Programme, an Urban Sports Club subsidy, and fitness activities, including on-site gym access, yoga sessions, and team sports&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚆 Benefit from subsidised public transport with the Deutschlandticket, offering unlimited travel on local and regional transport across Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗 Enjoy partially subsidised office lunches and weekly breakfast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Receive additional rewards through our employee referral programme when referring talents to join our team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us as a (Senior) Full Stack Developer - Web (f/m/d) in Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Story&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Developer (Web Platform)&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape and scale thinkcell’s web platform and enable multiple teams to efficiently manage and publish content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role for someone who only wants to work within a fixed web stack or maintain existing templates. We are looking for a web engineer who enjoys solving complex technical problems, making sound architectural decisions, and building systems that remain robust and maintainable as requirements evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across frontend and backend, improve the technical foundation of our web platform, and help us build scalable solutions that enable our teams to manage and publish content. Along the way, you will collaborate closely with stakeholders across design, marketing, product and engineering but with strong ownership over technical quality, long-term maintainability, and the overall direction of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and evolve our web platform features across front-end and CMS back-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex technical problems in a pragmatic way, balancing speed of delivery with long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural improvements that make our web ecosystem more robust, scalable, and easier to work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve our back-end functionality in PHP and Laravel for integrations, dynamic features, and internal tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and optimize our CMS and publishing workflows to support efficient content operations without compromising technical quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve performance, Core Web Vitals, accessibility, and technical SEO foundations across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on the evolution of our current web architecture, while also challenging existing approaches when better solutions exist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design, marketing, product, and engineering teams to turn business requirements into well-structured technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with back-end systems written in C++, ensuring reliable and efficient data exchange across system boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve developer experience, reduce complexity, and raise the overall engineering standard of the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of technical tasks and help define best practices for modern web development at think-cell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building and shipping production-grade web platforms, applications, or systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to solve non-trivial technical problems and work confidently in complex web related codebases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full stack engineering skills, with solid backend experience in PHP, Laravel, or similar technologies and a frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong frontend fundamentals, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript and modern approaches to building maintainable user interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgment when making architectural and technical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic mindset: you know when to build for flexibility and when to keep things simple&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and confidence to work with unfamiliar technologies or domains when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of ownership and responsibility for code quality, maintainability, and technical outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating across disciplines and communicating clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Statamic CMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with static site generation challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Deployment Tools such as Jenkins or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Tailwind, Alpine.js, or similar frontend tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving performance-critical, SEO-relevant, or content-heavy platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python for automation or tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with non-web backend systems or services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Thinking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We embrace change and challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
