&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why is thinkcell the right place for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower over 1.3 million users across 35,000 companies, including top consulting firms and major global enterprises. With offices in Berlin, Munich, Denver, Boston, London, Tokyo, and Dubai, we’re a diverse team of over 220 people, committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;think-cell is more than a job – it&#39;s a chance to be part of an innovative, inclusive team that values collaboration and growth. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. Together, we can shape the future of productivity software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We can’t wait to see what you’ll bring to the team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Software Engineer to help shape and build the next generation of our network automation platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our challenge is one of scale, complexity and criticality. We operate a massive global network supporting PlayStation Network, spanning more than 40 interconnection locations and 20+ data centres worldwide. Operating infrastructure at this scale safely and efficiently requires us to move beyond specialist-driven workflows and individual automation tools toward reliable, declarative software platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will help make that transition. You will work on software that turns complex network and infrastructure operations into reliable, API-driven and increasingly self-service capabilities. This includes building control-plane services, declarative APIs and intent-based controllers that manage production infrastructure safely and consistently across our global footprint.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a Staff-level engineering role with significant technical influence. You will combine hands-on engineering with setting technical direction: defining architectures, solving complex cross-system and distributed-systems problems, writing designs, driving alignment with senior engineers and architects, and mentoring engineers across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your work will directly influence how one of the world&#39;s largest gaming networks is operated and automated, while establishing engineering patterns and platforms that can be reused across multiple network domains and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide technical leadership and architectural direction for network automation and infrastructure control platforms, treating the self-service network API as a product by working with users and partner teams to define outcomes, establish clear expectations for API behavior and reliability, align on team responsibilities, and ensure those commitments are met.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Use domain-driven design with network experts, software engineers and API consumers to establish shared language and bounded contexts, then turn those agreements into versioned, testable contracts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design and build APIs, services, controllers and reconciliation workflows that manage production infrastructure safely at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build on the Kubernetes API, including custom resources and control loops that continuously converge actual state toward declared intent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the operational Kubernetes path: CRD rollout, RBAC and admission, controller health, Helm packaging, deployment drift and incident diagnosis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design distributed workflows that operate correctly under eventual consistency, at-least-once delivery, concurrent writes and partial failure, with idempotency and safe recovery as fundamental properties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design stable APIs, schemas and data models used across team boundaries, including versioning and backwards compatibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop patterns for multi-tenant infrastructure platforms, including tenant isolation, authorization, policy enforcement and safe automation boundaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establish strong approaches to testing, observability and change safety for software that changes live infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Improve software delivery practices through automated CI gates, versioned artifacts, controlled promotion, and safe deployment and recovery strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead complex migrations and modernization of existing automation, services and data models, evaluating when components should be evolved, replaced or rewritten, and ensuring safe coexistence, behavioral compatibility and retirement of legacy paths.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive technical alignment across software engineering, networking, operations and architecture teams; lead decisions within your area of accountability, contribute constructively to decisions owned by others, and make technology choices based on long-term company and product value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers, lead technical and design reviews, and raise software engineering standards across the wider organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in a backend language such as Python, Go, Rust or Java, including asynchronous concurrency, static typing, data modelling and validation, API development, packaging and tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong experience building Kubernetes controllers or operators, including custom resources and reconciliation/control-loop patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong experience building event-driven distributed systems, particularly eventual consistency, at-least-once delivery, idempotency, optimistic concurrency and partial-failure handling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing and building self-service, multi-tenant platforms, including tenant isolation, policy and access control.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong API and schema design skills, including versioning and schema evolution for interfaces consumed by other teams and systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated technical leadership across team boundaries, including driving architectural designs, building agreement among senior technical stakeholders and mentoring other engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A track record of taking ambiguous, technically complex problems from architecture through to reliable production systems that manage large-scale infrastructure, such as networks, compute or cloud resources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Networking fundamentals, particularly BGP, IP fabrics and VXLAN/EVPN/L3VPN.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Go, sufficient to understand and contribute to adjacent services and controllers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing testing and observability strategies for production infrastructure automation, including systems and backends that cannot be fully reproduced in CI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with graph databases, or with source-of-truth systems that model infrastructure and its relationships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will help establish the architecture and engineering practices behind a new generation of network automation, moving from individual scripts and specialist-driven workflows toward declarative, model-driven and reliable platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Staff level, your impact is expected to extend beyond the code you personally deliver. You will help shape the APIs and designs other teams build on, develop other engineers, and establish technical patterns that can be reused across multiple network domains and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

Are you a bit tired of the standard, old-fashioned way of doing things in the construction industry?&nbsp;
Do you get deep satisfaction from making things run more efficiently using a good dose of common sense and maybe a bit of technology?&nbsp;
Have you always cared about the importance of proper planning and the connection between the schedule and the real, day-to-day delivery of the job?&nbsp;
Have you ever wanted to work a bit more flexibly but still be hands-on in construction and improving the industry?&nbsp;
Sounds like a dream. Well, it isn’t. It’s quite real! Read on.&nbsp;
____________________________________________________________
We are Laminar Projects!
&nbsp;
If you’ve already heard about us, you’re probably reading this because you’re tired of the typical, chaotic ways of doing things in construction. But in case you haven’t, we’re a high-end project management consultancy and tech developer with a focus on upgrading the way construction projects are delivered.
&nbsp;
Improving construction strengthens the very foundation of human civilisation. (Check out our short film about it.) 
We bring transparency and control to projects through a pragmatic mix of the latest tech, our own processes, and a big dose of common sense. We then take our deep understanding of these projects and we invest heavily into developing the digital solutions that anyone can use to deliver their projects better. (Check out Shape, our construction management tech, to see what we’re doing.)
&nbsp;
The core of all this is our true secret sauce: our people. We only recruit the very best, both in capability and personality. We’re deeply focused on designing a new type of organisation that’s optimised for the flourishing of the people in the team first and foremost. People who join us develop fast as a whole person in ways they never imagined. (Read more about our vision and missions.)
&nbsp;
This approach has allowed us to grow from just two people in 2017 to over 220 today. We have a stable, repeat client base across infrastructure and complex building projects in the UK and internationally, and we’re still growing fast. Joining us isn’t just some “job”. It’s a transformative educational experience. We challenge you to be your best self in all aspects of life. There are many diverse and interesting challenges available. It’s up to you to guide yourself into whichever areas you’re most interested – we’ll enable it.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
(Get to know us better by watching a few more of our videos.)
&nbsp;
Core values for a good life
&nbsp;
A life of human flourishing is all about meaningful relationships and challenging yourself to create a positive impact, so our values reflect the four levels of relationships that each of us has:
&nbsp;
- Grow yourself – your relationship with yourself&nbsp;
- Care about people – your relationship with others around you&nbsp;
- Execute to greatness – your relationship with your team&nbsp;
- Build civilisation – your relationship with humanity and the world&nbsp;
&nbsp;
We enshrined our values in our vision:
&nbsp;
We exist so that everyone in our team can flourish in a high-impact community that:
&nbsp;
- Connects us with meaningful relationships&nbsp;
- Inspires us to develop ourselves to become better humans&nbsp;
- Empowers us to pursue our own learning adventures&nbsp;
&nbsp;
By first doing this, we can achieve the highest levels of value for the world.
&nbsp;
And enable the achievement of our vision through our two missions:
&nbsp;
- To fully digitalise the construction of human civilisation&nbsp;
- To create a new type of organisation that enables human flourishing while delivering a huge positive impact on society&nbsp;
____________________________________________________________
The Role&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Purpose of the role&nbsp;
&nbsp;
You’ll be enhancing the delivery of the most complex and interesting projects in the world through the power of project planning to the very highest standards. You’ll devise strategies and tactics to improve the way the project is delivered. You’ll translate this knowledge into a logic-linked plan and analyse it using planning software. Then you’ll use the plan to help the teams understand what to prioritise.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Your team&nbsp;
&nbsp;
This role is part of our Project Management Consultancy team which focuses on:
&nbsp;
- Understanding what the real problems of projects are&nbsp;
- Implementing the best solutions to those problems&nbsp;
- Developing scalable best practices, tools and technology&nbsp;
&nbsp;
More specifically, you’ll be part of our Project Planning Team, who are industry leaders in the planning of complex construction projects. Your initial leader will be one of our planning discipline directors.
&nbsp;
Your top three objectives&nbsp;
&nbsp;
1. To make construction projects deliver to near perfection&nbsp;
2. To create scalable and repeatable solutions to common problems&nbsp;
3. To develop yourself and everyone around you&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Your top five responsibilities&nbsp;
&nbsp;
1. Own the plan: Own the project plan for one or more projects and ensure that the project is working to it effectively. Ensure delays are mitigated and managed commercially&nbsp;
2. Own the outcome: You're responsible for putting in your best effort to ensure the project team’s understanding and focus on the plan – no matter how stubborn they are&nbsp;
3. Report and inform: Provide simple, actionable reports to stakeholders at all levels that help them deliver their part of the project more efficiently and effectively&nbsp;
4. Make scalable solutions: Develop scalable and repeatable best practices and tools in collaboration with the team so that long-term impact is achieved&nbsp;
5. Develop everyone: Maximise the development of your team personally and professionally and educate our clients to improve as well&nbsp;&nbsp;
&nbsp;
You must have:
&nbsp;
- A construction engineering background: You have at least 2+ years of experience on construction projects, experience in project planning both software and principles, as well as decent Excel skills, and a strong interest in data
- Communication skills: You’re proficient in written and verbal English and have the charisma and influence to get construction people to do new things and take the best approach&nbsp;
- Leadership capabilities: You lead yourself proactively and lead others by asking the right questions and challenging them&nbsp;
- Impact: You have a track record of making projects and organisations better beyond just doing the basics – implementing scalable, repeatable solutions that had a significant positive impact&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Laminar isn’t the place for you if any of the following is true:&nbsp;
&nbsp;
- You want an easy, chilled-out role without much challenge&nbsp;
- You like to be the smartest person in the room&nbsp;
- You don’t like continuously receiving honest candid feedback&nbsp;
- You prefer to do your own thing rather than work with a team
____________________________________________________________
Frequently Asked Questions&nbsp;
&nbsp;
What kinds of projects would I be working on?
It’s common for people to be exposed to several projects in their first year with us. You’ll work on some of the most complex and interesting environments in the world. We’ve delivered over 100 data centres internationally, many of them fast-tracked and multi-package. Our teams have supported flagship infrastructure programmes like HS2 through integrated planning and digital delivery, contributed to over $30bn in power generation and transmission projects, and played a key role in the development of high-containment labs and R&amp;D campuses for some of the world’s most advanced industrial and life sciences clients. You might find yourself working in sectors such as data centres, infrastructure (including defense, rail, and highways), high tech (such as advanced manufacturing, pharmaceuticals, and semiconductors), or complex building projects. These aren’t hands-off assignments. They’re dynamic, hands-on environments designed for people who want to be challenged. We bring back the lessons from every project to help our team grow and deliver the highest levels of value. (Check out our case stories.)&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Who are our clients?
Major owners/operators and main contractors with project values between £1m and £1bn+ globally.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Where would I be working?
One week you might be working from home. The next, you might travel to the site to meet the construction teams and help organise them. Maybe you’ll pop into our London office for a workshop or a beer. Maybe you’ll fly out to exotic (and sometimes not!) locations in Europe or the Middle East to visit clients. It really depends on what you want to get involved in and what fits with your life.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
How does what I do connect with the long-term impact on the construction industry?&nbsp;
You’re tasked with understanding and solving common problems. We don’t want to reinvent the wheel every time, so you’ll be responsible for documenting new solutions and evolving ones we’ve developed. This goes into our knowledge repository, which we’re going to open source to the industry.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
The knowledge you capture will be used by us to build new products. You’ll constantly test those products in the field, so we can rapidly iterate and improve them for anyone in the industry to use.&nbsp;
&nbsp;

____________________________________________________________
&nbsp;

Benefits
&nbsp;
The standard stuff:&nbsp;
&nbsp;
- Bonus Scheme. As a permanent member of the team, you’ll share in our success. Our annual bonus is designed to reward both the now and the future - with a flexible mix of cash and high-growth equity that you choose. Bonuses are discretionary and based on performance&nbsp;
- Professional body membership. One fee covered per year - so you can stay connected to your field and develop your craft&nbsp;
&nbsp;
The life-changing stuff:
&nbsp;
- In-house coaching. Regular 1:1 coaching sessions, fully confidential, to help you navigate challenges, build self-awareness, and grow intentionally - professionally and as a human being
- Equity upside. As we grow, you grow. Our generous equity scheme is especially powerful for those who stay with us on our journey. You help us build the future - and own a piece of it
- Flexible working. Work where it makes sense - most of our team works from home, visiting sites or clients regularly. We care about outcomes, not clock-ins
- Relentless development. Our goal is for every year here to be worth five years of development anywhere else. You’ll get a coach, a mentor, honest feedback, and a culture that challenges you to keep levelling up


____________________________________________________________
&nbsp;
Important! Applying properly
&nbsp;
We get thousands of applications so please write us a letter as part of your application explaining:
&nbsp;
- Why you want to join us&nbsp;
- What you’ll bring to the team&nbsp;
&nbsp;
We aren't a giant, faceless corporation; we really care about the people who want to join our team, so your letter will be read carefully. After that, we’ll reach out to you to schedule a casual conversation to help you get to know us a bit better and tell us a bit about yourself. A couple of technical and personal assessments follow to understand your capability based on our own development matrix.&nbsp;&nbsp;
&nbsp;
This is to ensure that when you join, you’re starting at the right level of responsibility.Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Vollzeit, ab sofort, unbefristet, Standort Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Die/Der Head of Data, GSA führt die Data-Intelligence-Unit für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz und spielt eine zentrale Rolle bei der Förderung einer datengestützten Unternehmenskultur. In dieser Matrixfunktion agiert die/der Head of Data an der Schnittstelle zwischen lokalen Business Units und den regionalen sowie globalen Data-Intelligence-Teams. Die Position verbindet strategische Beratung der Business Units, analytische und technische Führung, die Entwicklung von Talenten sowie die Zusammenarbeit über Länder- und Funktionsgrenzen hinweg. Die/Der Head of Data stellt sicher, dass Daten und Insights einen messbaren Beitrag zu den regionalen Businessprioritäten leisten und gleichzeitig im Einklang mit den Data-Intelligence-Strategien auf regionaler und globaler Ebene stehen.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du machst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übersetzt komplexe Daten durch regelmäßige und Ad-hoc-Analysen in klare, umsetzbare Empfehlungen für unterschiedliche Stakeholder und entwickelst ein tiefes Verständnis der geschäftlichen Prioritäten in den betreuten Märkten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du treibst die Weiterentwicklung von Analytics von deskriptiven hin zu diagnostischen und prädiktiven Ansätzen voran und bleibst dabei eng in analytische Fragestellungen eingebunden, indem du Methoden, Herangehensweisen und Best Practices aktiv mitgestaltest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du setzt die regionale Data-Intelligence-Strategie für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz um und überführst strategische Prioritäten in konkrete Maßnahmen für Reporting, Tools, Datenprodukte und Capability Building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du koordinierst die Zusammenarbeit mit Datenteams über mehrere Märkte hinweg, förderst den Austausch von Best Practices und stellst Konsistenz bei KPI-Definitionen, Reporting-Standards und Governance sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt die Entwicklung und Implementierung regionaler KPI-Frameworks, Dashboards und Reporting-Standards sowie die Migration auf moderne Datenplattformen und KI-gestützte Workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du befähigst Business-Teams durch Trainings zu Datentools, Dashboards und Self-Service-Analytics-Lösungen und fungierst als Schnittstelle zwischen Business-Stakeholdern und technischen Teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du agierst als vertrauenswürdige:r Sparringspartner:in für Senior Stakeholder in der GSA-Region, vertrittst lokale Perspektiven und Geschäftsanforderungen in regionalen und globalen Data-Initiativen und sorgst für eine erfolgreiche Balance zwischen lokalen Bedürfnissen und übergeordneten strategischen Zielsetzungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du schaffst die Balance zwischen regionalen Standards und lokalen Marktanforderungen, überzeugst Stakeholder durch klare Kommunikation und datenbasiertes Storytelling und förderst die Akzeptanz datengetriebener Entscheidungen auf allen Ebenen der Organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du förderst eine Kultur der Zusammenarbeit und kontinuierlichen Verbesserung, unterstützt die fachliche Weiterentwicklung des Teams und stellst eine effektive Priorisierung sowie Ressourcenplanung sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wer du bist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über umfangreiche Erfahrung in Analytics, Data Science, Insights oder vergleichbaren Bereichen, idealerweise in einem regionalen oder Multi-Markt-Umfeld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du überzeugst durch starke Kommunikations-, Stakeholder-Management- und Problemlösungsfähigkeiten und bist in der Lage, komplexe Sachverhalte verständlich aufzubereiten sowie geschäftliche Herausforderungen in datenbasierte Lösungen zu übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast deine Führungsstärke sowohl durch die direkte Führung von Mitarbeitenden als auch durch die fachliche Leitung von Projekten und funktionsübergreifenden Teams unter Beweis gestellt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst fundierte Erfahrung im Aufbau und in der Weiterentwicklung von Reporting-Lösungen, Dashboards, KPI-Frameworks sowie im Umgang mit Data-Governance-Prinzipien mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über eine ausgeprägte analytische und technische Expertise sowie sehr gute Kenntnisse in SQL (Snowflake), Python und Datenvisualisierungstools wie Streamlit, Tableau oder vergleichbaren Technologien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest kollaborativ, proaktiv und möchtest Verantwortung in einem strategischen und internationalen Umfeld übernehmen und weiter ausbauen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Musikindustrie ist von Vorteil, insbesondere ein gutes Verständnis von Streaming-Geschäftsmodellen, digitalem Musikkonsum und den wesentlichen Marktdynamiken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wir bieten dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raum für Vielfalt und für Innovation.&amp;nbsp;Die Freiheit, Prozesse und Methoden zu challengen und zu revolutionieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individuelle Benefits-Pakete kombinierbar aus ÖPNV-Zuschuss, Job-Rad und einem Sport-Abo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitszeiten und Homeoffice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge. Ein Streaming-Abo deiner Wahl.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sowie Konzerte und Events in ganz Deutschland und in unserem schicken Headquarter mitten in Schöneberg.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exklusive Trainings in der hauseigenen Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sowie das Vertrauen, deine Projekte in Eigenregie zum Erfolg zu führen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie du dich bewirbst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dein Foto, Alter, Familienstand, deine Herkunft, Zeugnisse, die Jobs deiner Eltern und andere Merkmale benötigen wir nicht.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeige uns in einem CV oder einer anderen kreativen Form, was dich ausmacht, was du kannst und warum Sony Music mit dir besser klingt!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf dich.&lt;br&gt;Sony Music sounds better with you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music Entertainment GmbH&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sonymusic.de/&quot;&gt;www.sonymusic.de/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please click here&amp;nbsp;to read our privacy policy for &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.sme-static.com/files/Job%20Applicant%20Privacy%20Policy.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sonymusic.at/datenschutz/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Austria &lt;/a&gt;or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sonymusic.ch/datenschutz/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Switzerland &lt;/a&gt;before beginning the application process as you will need to agree to the terms of the policy before submitting your information.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, our mission is simple: to change the way people eat, forever. We are a global digital-native FMCG company and the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider. The HelloFresh Group includes eight brands serving customers across multiple meal occasions: HelloFresh, Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chefs Plate, Factor, YouFoodz, Good Chop, and The Pets Table. Through technology, data, and culinary innovation, we deliver personalized food experiences to millions of households worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Designer to join our global Consumer Experience team, working in either &lt;strong&gt;Growth or Consumer&lt;/strong&gt;. This is a senior, hands-on individual contributor role in an AI-native design environment. You&#39;ll own a problem space, influence what we build and why, and raise the standard of the designers around you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your focus area is confirmed during the process:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; acquisition, conversion, checkout, payment, reactivation, and new purchase models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer:&lt;/strong&gt; onboarding, subscription management, loyalty and rewards, referrals, discovery, cooking, and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloTech, flexibility and cross-functional collaboration are core to how we work. While this role is aligned to a specific Alliance, strong candidates may also be considered for opportunities across different teams or projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own critical customer journeys end to end, from problem framing to a shipped, measured outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex customer and business problems into simple experiences that communicate value clearly, reduce friction and build trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Data, Marketing, CRM, and other UX practitioners to shape product direction, balancing near-term impact with long-term customer trust and value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable patterns that hold across meal kits and ready-to-heat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI throughout your practice, from synthesis and discovery to rapid prototyping and design-to-code, with tools such as Claude, Claude Code, Gemini, and Figma Make, and explore AI-native customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build alignment through evidence and clear rationale and raise the bar on your squad through critique and shared practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically &lt;strong&gt;4–6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of product design experience, though we care more about the scope, complexity, and impact of your work than years alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end ownership&lt;/strong&gt; of complex experiences, ideally in e-commerce, subscription, marketplace, or loyalty, with outcomes: what moved, by how much, and what you did when a result came back wrong.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional interface craft:&lt;/strong&gt; interaction and visual design, information architecture, motion, and micro-interactions. Your portfolio shows judgment (what you decided and why), not just polish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; you turn data and customer insight into design bets without trading away trust and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in your daily workflow.&lt;/strong&gt; You give it the context and intent it needs, and you audit what comes back. Curiosity and appetite for working in code and AI-native tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; when the copy is wrong you fix it, and nothing falls between job descriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with &lt;strong&gt;ambiguity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;clear communication&lt;/strong&gt; across Product, Engineering, Data, and your fellow UX practitioners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t meet every requirement? Apply anyway.&lt;/strong&gt; If you meet most of these requirements and are excited about the role, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&amp;nbsp;Above all, we want people who will make HelloFresh better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits and perks apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Berlin:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diverse community of 90+ nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay, including a company-subsidized pension scheme, relocation support, and hybrid working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts on the weekly HelloFresh box and office meals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth: German language budget and access to HelloFresh Academy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, company days, and ERGs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing: mental health support (Headspace, Spill), 24/7 gym access, transport perks, working-parent-friendly benefits, and sabbatical options, dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warsaw:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with experienced engineers and product partners across international teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-impact work: systems at global scale serving 6M+ customers and complex supply chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership opportunities in an autonomous, product-led setup, with influence over architecture, design, and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end ownership, from problem definition to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern hub at Warsaw Centre Point with showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toronto:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal kit discounts: 75% off HelloFresh and Chefs Plate, 50% off Factor, one box per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and dental from day 1, a Health Spending Account, Headspace, and 25% off GoodLife memberships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RRSP matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous vacation/PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave top-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development support from a dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, company days, and ERGs (FreshPride, Women Empowered, LIMES)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food puns (including punny meeting room names)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$98,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$108,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 class=&quot;ql-header-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the &lt;span class=&quot;Highlight ht8de9e54e-80f2-4c83-a0bc-8306711420fe&quot;&gt;Box&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Growth Alliance&lt;/strong&gt; powers &lt;span class=&quot;Highlight ht8de9e54e-80f2-4c83-a0bc-8306711420fe&quot;&gt;HelloFresh&lt;/span&gt;’s marketing engine, from media investment and in-channel optimization, to the conversion funnel, to how and when we communicate with customers. As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will design and ship statistical and machine learning models that turn data from experiments, campaigns, and customer behavior into decisions that directly move the business: how we spend our marketing budget, how we convert visitors into customers, and how we personalize every touchpoint along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join one of several teams within the alliance, spanning marketing measurement and attribution, channel optimisation, funnel optimisation and decisioning on customer communications and messaging. Across all of these topics, the through line is the same: rigorous modeling, close collaboration with engineering and marketing stakeholders, and a bias toward shipping models that work in production, not just in a notebook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed in this role, you should be a curious, pragmatic problem solver who relentlessly prioritizes based on impact, is comfortable with statistical uncertainty, and can translate a fuzzy business question into a concrete, testable model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloTech, flexibility and cross-functional collaboration are core to how we work. While this role is aligned to a specific Alliance, strong candidates may also be considered for opportunities across different teams or projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and take ownership of statistical and machine learning models, from data collection through to production, closely aligning the approach with non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate within cross-functional teams (engineering, product, marketing) to translate business objectives into concrete, data-driven strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experimentation: design tests, define success metrics and guardrails, and interpret results while accounting for statistical uncertainty, noise, and bias.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously iterate and refine your technical approach, monitor model performance, data reliability, and drift once in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retrieve, manipulate, and analyze large, heterogeneous datasets, and build the data pipelines your models depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think beyond the immediate ask to find new ways to improve the data products delivered to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a senior member of the team, jump in to help solve problems as they arise, and support and coach more junior data scientists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of scientific work through a Bachelor’s, Master’s, or PhD in statistics, physics, economics, mathematics, data science, or a related quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional experience as a (senior) data scientist or in a related quantitative role, ideally in e-commerce, marketing, or a comparably high-traffic, consumer-facing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong marketing and/or growth domain knowledge, with experience applying statistical models such as regressors and classifiers, and interpreting experiment results under real-world uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Python and its scientific stack (NumPy, Pandas, Scikit-learn, Matplotlib); comfortable retrieving and analyzing data with SQL. Experience with Databricks/Spark is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with software engineering practices and tools (Git, Docker, AWS or similar cloud environments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using recent Gen AI tools (e.g.&amp;nbsp;Claude Code) to design and build solutions in a structured and pragmatic manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical thinker and creative problem solver who is comfortable proposing and prioritizing multiple solutions based on effort and likely impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player with exceptional communication skills, able to work with stakeholders from different backgrounds in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have (domain specific), if you find yourself in one of the below, it’s a huge plus!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; attribution:&lt;/strong&gt; experience with media mix models, attribution modeling, or incrementality measurement; Bayesian forecasting and estimating model uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search or Social channel optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; experience with the Google/Meta ecosystem or other paid channels, forecasting algorithms, portfolio optimization, or Vector Autoregression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversion &amp;amp; personalization:&lt;/strong&gt; experience building decisioning or recommendation models that run in production behind high-traffic conversion funnels; customer segmentation and behavioral data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Messaging &amp;amp; send decisioning:&lt;/strong&gt; direct experience with reinforcement learning or contextual bandits (e.g.&amp;nbsp;Thompson Sampling, epsilon-greedy), off-policy/counterfactual evaluation, or CRM and marketing decisioning use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient?&lt;/strong&gt; If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#DATA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Mitarbeiter Qualitätssicherung (all genders) unterstützt Du gemeinsam mit dem Quality Supervisor die Umsetzung und Einhaltung der Qualitätssicherungs- sowie Qualitätskontrollprozesse (QS/QC) im operativen Tagesgeschäft. Dabei überwachst und bewertest Du sowohl die betrieblichen Abläufe als auch die Produktqualität vor Ort. Somit leistest Du einen wichtigen Beitrag zur Sicherstellung unserer Produktqualität und bist von Beginn an ein wertvoller Teil des Teams und unserer Mission: We want to change the way people eat forever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prüfung&lt;/strong&gt; eingehender Lebensmittel inkl. Verpackungen auf Frische, Mängel und Einhaltung der Qualitätsvorgaben in Kollaboration mit funktionsübergreifenden Produktionsteams zur Gewährleistung einheitlicher, sicherer Lebensmittelstandards&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kontrolle&lt;/strong&gt; von Etiketten, Chargennummern und Mindesthaltbarkeitsdaten im gesamten Lagerbestand zur Sicherstellung einer lückenlosen Rückverfolgbarkeit der Produkte und präzisen Nachverfolgung der Haltbarkeitsdauer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Überwachung&lt;/strong&gt; der Produktions-, Sortier- und Temperaturkontrollprozesse, um die vollständige Einhaltung lokaler Qualitäts- sowie Hygienestandards am Standort zu garantieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dokumentation&lt;/strong&gt; von Prüfergebnissen und Qualitätsabweichungen mithilfe hochwertiger Bildaufnahmen im digitalen Qualitätskontroll-Tool (QC) zur Bereitstellung von Echtzeitdaten und umsetzbaren Erkenntnissen für die Qualitätsverantwortlichen vor Ort&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durchführung&lt;/strong&gt; von Korrekturmaßnahmen und Prozessvalidierungen bei auftretenden Abweichungen zur Vermeidung der Weiterleitung minderwertiger Artikel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Förderung&lt;/strong&gt; der HelloFresh-Qualitätskultur durch die aktive Teilnahme an regelmäßigen internen Schulungen und der kontinuierlichen Verbesserung der Qualitätsstandards im gesamten Werk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abgeschlossene Ausbildung oder fundierte Erfahrung im Lebensmittelbereich (Lebensmittelindustrie, Lebensmittelhandel, Gastronomie)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste Berufserfahrung in der Beurteilung/Bewertung von Lebensmitteln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begeisterung für die Arbeit mit Nahrungsmitteln&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selbstständige, strukturierte Arbeitsweise und ein ausgeprägtes Auge fürs Detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohes Maß an Verantwortungsbewusstsein und Eigeninitiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft zur Schicht- und Wochenendarbeit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- (mind.&amp;nbsp; C1-Niveau) und gute Englischkenntnisse (wünschenswert)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz&lt;/strong&gt; mit einem tollen Team in Barleben bei Magdeburg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte auf unsere HelloFresh Kochboxen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt; durch interne Trainings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein kompetitives Gehalt und ggf. Schichtzulagen &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Tage Urlaub &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote &lt;/strong&gt;bei Urban Sports Club bzw. John Reed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen monatlichen Zuschuss zum Deutschlandticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Selgros Karte &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persönliche Sicherheitsausrüstung &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bist du die fehlende Zutat?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Wenn diese Gelegenheit für Dich lecker klingt, freuen wir uns darauf, von Dir zu hören. Wir bemühen uns, Dein Profil zu prüfen und Dir innerhalb von 5 Werktagen zu antworten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#barnquality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Global Paid Marketing owns how HelloFresh Group buys customers across its portfolio of brands and markets. The team spans Paid Social, Paid Search, Display &amp;amp; Video, Partnerships &amp;amp; Affiliates, Creative Strategy and the Creators program, and steers one of the largest acquisition budgets in direct-to-consumer. We are rebuilding the organization around fewer, stronger channel leaders and an AI-first way of working, and this role is central to making that model run.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Associate Director of Paid Strategy to own the strategy, planning and operating backbone of Global Paid Marketing. Reporting to the Head of Global Paid Marketing, you will set how the paid portfolio plans its budget, runs its business reviews and prioritizes and delivers its biggest bets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Channel leaders own their numbers. You own the system around them: the plan they commit to, the cadence that holds them to it, the cross-channel programs no single team owns, and the insightsthat turns many channels and dozens of entities into one clear view of the business. It is a role with unusual breadth and visibility, built for someone who wants to understand how a large paid organization is run, not just how one channel performs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work directly with the paid leadership team, with StratOps as your closest partner: StratOps sets the company-wide growth agenda and governance, and you translate it into how paid team plans, operates and reports, then bring the paid view back into that agenda. You will also partner closely with Finance, Analytics, HR and Brand. This role is primarily designed as an Individual Contributor position: ; your impact&amp;nbsp; comes from the quality of your thinking, the rigor of your follow-through and the trust you earn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid strategy and planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the planning cycle for the global paid portfolio: annual Business Plan, half-year budgets and monthly MBT re-forecasts, from channel-mix and entity allocation through to CAC and volume guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with StratOps and Finance so paid commitments tie to company targets, and pressure-test every submission based on run-rates and data-driven assumptions&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the multi-year paid strategy: where to invest, where to pull back, and which capabilities the organization needs to build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating rhythm and governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run the operating cadence of the paid organization: weekly and monthly business reviews, QBRs, leadership team meetings and senior leadership steerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set agendas, write or commission pre-reads, and own the decision and action log so every meeting ends with an owner and a date, and every commitment is followed through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the KPIs, targets and reporting standards that let leadership compare channels and entities on one consistent basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-channel programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the high-priority initiatives that span channels and no single team owns, such as measurement and incrementality, partner and agency consolidation, and AI adoption across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run them with clear scope, milestones and owners, and escalate early when they drift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and synthesize ad hoc strategic analysis to support paid leadership with decision marking or problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight and executive communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn performance across channels and entities into a single, narrative for senior leadership: CMO updates, QBRs, steering decks and budget reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high quality and consistent deliverable from the Paid team to Leadership to enable fast and informed decision making&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organization and capability planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support org design, headcount and people-cost planning for Global Paid Marketing, working with HR Business Partners and Talent Acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track priority hiring and internal moves, and keep one source of truth for the team&#39;s structure and capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive knowledge transfer and best-practice sharing across channels and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-enabled operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to automate recurring reporting, business-review preparation and forecasting, freeing leaders&#39; time for decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and introduce AI tools that improve planning, budget optimization and insight generation, and hold their output to account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in strategy and operations, growth strategy, management consulting or performance marketing at scale, including time close to senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong quantitative foundation: you can build a budget or forecast model, read an experiment, and defend a recommendation with data rather than opinion. SQL or equivalent is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in marketing economics: CAC, payback, incrementality, and how budget, channel mix and volume trade off against each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to run complex, cross-functional programs and to influence senior peers without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive-level communication: you write crisp pre-reads, build decks that make a point on page one, and can tell leadership what they need to hear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment and discretion with confidential information, including budgets, organization plans and people topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on use of AI to compress real analytical or operational work, not just as a search engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and shifting priorities; you bring structure where there is none and keep many threads moving at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points if you have owned a planning or budget cycle end to end, worked in a multi-brand or multi-market organization, or come from a top-tier consulting or strategy program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like in your first year&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The paid operating cadence runs on a fixed calendar, with standard pre-reads and a decision log that leadership trusts and uses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The next Business Plan and half-year budget submissions go in on time, from one source of truth, with every material assumption pressure-tested.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two or three cross-channel programs have landed with measurable impact on CAC, volume or team productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recurring reporting and review preparation are largely automated, and leaders spend their time on decisions rather than slides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior leadership gets one consistent, candid view of paid performance across channels and entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save with discount schemes with corporate benefits and Vorteile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to work with ease through sustainable travel perks and transportation benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy tasty in-office meal deals and fresh food options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working families with parent-friendly policies, an in-office kids corner, and an on-site babysitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on UICC/eUICC/eSIM specialist to take ownership of the engineering, interoperability, and certification readiness of our Consumer eSIM (SGP.22) and IoT eUICC (SGP.32) products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate across the full lifecycle, from profile design and technical specification to validation and production readiness, working at the intersection of SIM technology, devices, and mobile networks. The role is focused on ensuring our eSIM products meet a high bar for quality, reliability, and interoperability before rollout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your&amp;nbsp;Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;validation&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;SGP.22&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SGP.32&amp;nbsp;eSIM&amp;nbsp;products,&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;profile&amp;nbsp;design&amp;nbsp;reviews&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;translation&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;requirements&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;execute&amp;nbsp;certification&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;validation&amp;nbsp;strategies&amp;nbsp;using&amp;nbsp;GSMA&amp;nbsp;artefacts&amp;nbsp;(e.g.&amp;nbsp;SAIP,&amp;nbsp;BAP),&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;lab&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;real-world&amp;nbsp;interoperability&amp;nbsp;testing&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;devices&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;resolve&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;cross-domain&amp;nbsp;issues&amp;nbsp;(SIM,&amp;nbsp;device,&amp;nbsp;network),&amp;nbsp;providing&amp;nbsp;clear&amp;nbsp;root&amp;nbsp;cause&amp;nbsp;analysis&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;coordinating&amp;nbsp;fixes&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;external&amp;nbsp;vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;point&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;contact&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;remote&amp;nbsp;provisioning&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;(SMDP+,&amp;nbsp;eIM)&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SIM/eUICC&amp;nbsp;vendors,&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;defining&amp;nbsp;acceptance&amp;nbsp;criteria&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;supporting&amp;nbsp;go/no-go&amp;nbsp;decisions&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce&amp;nbsp;clear&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;documentation&amp;nbsp;(test&amp;nbsp;reports,&amp;nbsp;defect&amp;nbsp;analysis,&amp;nbsp;certification&amp;nbsp;status)&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;enable&amp;nbsp;Product,&amp;nbsp;Support,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Customer-facing&amp;nbsp;teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your&amp;nbsp;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;SIM/eSIM/eUICC&amp;nbsp;engineering,&amp;nbsp;validation,&amp;nbsp;certification,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;closely&amp;nbsp;related&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;GSMA&amp;nbsp;standards,&amp;nbsp;particularly&amp;nbsp;SGP.22&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SGP.32&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid&amp;nbsp;understanding&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;UICC/eUICC&amp;nbsp;architecture,&amp;nbsp;profile&amp;nbsp;lifecycle,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;OTA/provisioning&amp;nbsp;processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;designing&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;executing&amp;nbsp;test&amp;nbsp;strategies&amp;nbsp;using&amp;nbsp;certification-style&amp;nbsp;artefacts&amp;nbsp;(e.g.&amp;nbsp;SAIP,&amp;nbsp;BAP&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;debug&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;issues&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;SIM,&amp;nbsp;device,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;network&amp;nbsp;layers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;coordinate&amp;nbsp;resolution&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;multiple&amp;nbsp;stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;tyle&amp;nbsp;operational&amp;nbsp;models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Deposits Integration Operations team serves as the operational gatekeeper, configuration expert, and bridge between Product, Engineering, and Deposit-taking Banks (DtBs). The team is responsible for the end-to-end operational integration of banking partners, ensuring secure, automated, and audit-compliant deposit lifecycle management across the marketplace.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the processing of interest rate change requests from partner banks across all designated platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the creation, maintenance, and technical setup of partner bank profiles within the company&#39;s Content Management System (CMS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and maintain formal deposit documentation to ensure compliance and accuracy of information provided to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular quality assurance testing, data validation, and daily monitoring of operational workflows to safeguard data integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute end-to-end operational updates, ensuring all system changes are fully validated, documented, and published in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently an enrolled student in a university program, preferably in Business, Finance, Information Technology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess an extremely high level of precision and attention to detail, which is essential for managing critical interest rate changes and product attributes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong technical affinity and are comfortable working with complex software environments and tools like Jira and Slack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English with strong communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, you have some experience with Content Management Systems (e.g., Contentstack) or Business Intelligence tools like Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of or an interest in learning Jinja2 templating for dynamic document creation is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in other European languages (e.g., German, Spanish, or Dutch) and a general understanding of banking products are considered an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €400 and one full training day per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 20 vacation days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Design team at Raisin brings together product designers and brand &amp;amp; marketing designers. We are united by a shared belief in respect, creativity, and our purpose to give people financial peace of mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Senior Brand &amp;amp; Motion Designer, you&#39;ll join the Brand and Marketing Design team. We shape how Raisin looks, moves, and feels across every market we operate in: paid and organic social, our websites, product launches, and campaigns. You&#39;ll report to the Head of Brand and Marketing Design and work closely with Growth Marketing, Performance Marketing, CRM, Product, and Communications teams across Europe, the UK, and the US.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Motion is currently the most exciting greenfield area of our brand identity. We are looking for an entrepreneurial motion designer to define our motion principles, build scalable systems, and elevate our visual storytelling across all touchpoints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define Motion Principles:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape how the Raisin brand expresses itself through movement, establishing distinct principles for timing, easing, transitions, and typographic behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Scale Motion Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and maintain comprehensive motion guidelines, reusable component libraries, and After Effects/Figma/Jitter templates to enable efficient production across internal teams and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign &amp;amp; Social Creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Performance and Growth Marketing to produce high-performing motion assets (Meta, Google, YouTube, LinkedIn) and organic social content, from hero campaign assets to fast, iterative test variations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video Editing &amp;amp; Post-Production:&lt;/strong&gt; Edit and polish campaign videos, product teasers, and social cuts, managing pacing, sound design, light color grading, and burned-in captioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; UI Visualization:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Web and Product Design teams to create clear product animations and UI micro-interactions (delivered in production-ready formats like Lottie or Rive) that explain savings, investment, and pension concepts simply and transparently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead motion projects from concept to final export, including storyboards, styleframes, animation, QA, and oversight of external creative agencies or production partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Share motion expertise across the broader design team, empowering non-motion designers to think in movement and elevating the team&#39;s craft standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore emerging tools (including AI-assisted workflows) to streamline repetitive task execution without compromising visual quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of motion design experience, in-house or agency, ideally for fintech, tech, or brand-driven companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio showing brand motion work and marketing work: identity systems, campaigns, social content, and product or UI animation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in After Effects, Jitter, and Figma; highly proficient with the Adobe Creative Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of animation principles (timing, easing, staging, rhythm) and how motion communicates brand character.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of thinking in systems, building motion templates, libraries, and workflows that enable other designers to produce consistent work at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of paid and organic social: formats, safe zones, pacing, and what makes someone stop scrolling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative pragmatism: you know when to spend two days on a hero animation and when to ship a variation in two hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-Informed Approach: Curiosity about creative performance data and an eagerness to test, learn, and iterate based on results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI tools in a professional motion or image production workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent English skills with the ability to articulate design rationale clearly and incorporate feedback constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3D and animation skills (Cinema 4D, Blender).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience preparing production-ready Lottie or Rive animations for web and mobile apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of design requirements within regulated industries (finance, health, or insurance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

About us
Netlight provides a full range of premium IT-consulting services at the forefront of the digital industry and stands out for its product- and technology-independent expertise in a wide range of industries and clients. We are a network organization of more than 2 000 role models making aspiring digital leaders successful in their business-critical IT projects. Netlight has been awarded several times as top employer, as well as for growth, continued profitability and engagement for diversity, equity and equality within the IT industry. Today we are growing all across Europe, currently with more than 13 active international offices.
&nbsp;


The role
As a Senior AI/ML Consultant, you are the person clients trust to turn AI ambition into production reality. You design and build AI systems that hold up beyond the demo. Machine learning pipelines, generative AI solutions, and the technical foundations that let organisations extract real value from AI.


Our consultants bring varied paths and perspectives to this work. What unites them is a principled approach to system design, a genuine curiosity about the business problems behind each model, seeing work through from the first experiment to a system running in production. Across engagements, you may work as an ML engineer, AI architect, LLM/GenAI specialist, or a strategic advisor, often a combination of several within one engagement.
&nbsp;


What the work looks like
Building AI systems, shaping strategy. You design, build, and operationalise AI systems across the full stack, from data pipelines and feature engineering to LLM applications, RAG pipelines, and agentic workflows. You use MLOps practices to bring models into production reliably and keep them there. And you work with clients to make the decisions that matter: build versus buy, model selection, responsible AI, and the organisational change that turns AI from a pilot into a practice.


Delivering, leading, growing. You are growing as a consultant and a leader, not just delivering on the technical side. As a senior consultant, you are expected to take ownership beyond your immediate delivery: guiding junior colleagues, contributing to engagement quality, and beginning to build the presence and trust that defines the next stage of your career. Beyond client projects, you are will to contribute to Netlight's thought leadership within Data &amp; AI, whether through internal knowledge sharing, external publications, or coaching colleagues who are earlier in their journey.What we offer
Possibility to be part of growing one of the most successful tech consultancies in the industry.
Diverse client landscape, including some of the most innovative tech companies &amp; exciting projects with lots of room for professional development.
Access to an international network of 2,000+ highly talented individuals.
An experienced mentor and a professional coach to guide you throughout your career.
An international &amp; diverse working environment with a central and modern office space.
Competitive and transparent salary model with equal pay regardless of the assignment, biannual salary reviews, and attractive benefits (e.g. company shares, Deutschlandticket, parental benefits &amp; much more).
The freedom to shape your own path in terms of clients, domains, and roles, supported by a global community.
Access to Netlight's Edge network with its competence cells, conferences, and a culture where sharing knowledge is as valued as acquiring it. You are encouraged to contribute to Netlight's thought leadership within Data &amp; AI.
Minimum qualifications




Master's Degree in Engineering or Technology (e.g., Computer Science, Machine Learning, Mathematics, Statistics, or similar).






Verbal and written fluency in English.






2–4 years of full-time work experience in machine learning engineering, applied AI, or a closely related field. Experience working in agile product or delivery teams, gained after completing your Master's degree.&nbsp;






Strong hands-on experience with the full ML lifecycle: data preparation, feature engineering, model development, evaluation, deployment, and monitoring.&nbsp;






Practical experience building and deploying solutions on at least one major cloud platform (AWS, Azure, or GCP), including managed ML services (e.g., SageMaker, Vertex AI, Azure ML).






Hands-on experience with LLMs and generative AI, including prompt engineering, RAG architectures, and integrating foundation model APIs into production systems.&nbsp;






Experience with MLOps practices and tools, including experiment tracking, model registries, CI/CD for ML, and model serving infrastructure.&nbsp;






Proficiency in Python and relevant ML/AI frameworks (e.g., PyTorch, TensorFlow, Hugging Face, LangChain, or LlamaIndex).






Demonstrated ability to collaborate with diverse stakeholders — including data engineers, product owners, analysts, and business leaders — in client-facing settings.&nbsp;



&nbsp;


&nbsp;
Preferred qualifications



Experience designing agentic AI systems, including tool use, orchestration frameworks, and multi-agent architectures.&nbsp;






Depth in responsible AI and governance, including fairness, explainability, bias detection, and AI risk frameworks.&nbsp;






Experience fine-tuning or instruction-tuning foundation models (e.g., LoRA, RLHF, PEFT).






Familiarity with vector databases and semantic search infrastructure (e.g., Pinecone, Weaviate, pgvector, Qdrant).&nbsp;






Background in NLP, computer vision, or time-series forecasting in applied production settings.&nbsp;






Experience with data and AI platform architecture, including feature stores, data lakes, and lakehouse patterns.&nbsp;





Equal opportunity statement


Netlight strives to be a truly diverse,&nbsp;equitable&nbsp;and inclusive organization. Regardless of who you are, what personality, background, and experience you have, you enrich our culture through your values.&nbsp;Netlight’s&nbsp;purpose is to unleash full potential, realize great careers, and&nbsp;fulfill&nbsp;personal growth. To achieve this, we have a highly engaged network organization, where every employee gets a mentor, delivery&nbsp;coach&nbsp;and personal communities. The key to our continued success is trust and personal responsibility, diverse experiences, challenging opportunities and developing from personal values. Every&nbsp;Netlighter&nbsp;is an active part of building and shaping this culture, which leads to a clear correlation between personal growth and the growth of Netlight.&nbsp;
&nbsp;

Ready to shape the future with us? If we find that your profile matches what we are looking for, you will hear from us within two weeks of applying.&nbsp;


