&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Professional Services, Engagement Manager - - Germany&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Professional Services Engagement Manager focused on Germany, you will play a critical role in driving GitLab’s growth in the region by structuring services engagements that create true partnership and shared success with our customers. You will lead efforts to design, position, and close outcome-oriented professional services engagements that translate complex DevSecOps and digital transformation initiatives into clear, measurable mission-critical outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Senior Manager of Engagement Management, EMEA, you will work at the intersection of technical solutioning and customer requirements, aligning each engagement to their unique needs and objectives.&amp;nbsp; In your first year, you will build trusted advisor relationships with technical leaders and partners to help integrate professional services into account strategies from early discovery through successful delivery. This is a unique opportunity to shape large-scale implementations that improve how customers plan, build, secure, and operate software using GitLab.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some examples of our projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and structuring outcome-based professional services engagements that align GitLab capabilities to customers needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with account executives, solutions architects, and delivery leaders to turn complex DevSecOps transformations into clear, actionable implementation roadmaps and statements of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted advisor relationships with division chiefs, program managers, and technical leaders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct discovery sessions with with prospects and Systems Integrators to understand current-state capabilities, requirements and desired business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design outcome-oriented services proposals that align GitLab capabilities with customer success metrics and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure engagements and commercial proposals to clear outcomes maintaining flexibility for staff augmentation and packaged offerings when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop custom-scoped SOWs and staffing plans for complex implementations, engaging with technical architects and delivery leadership to ensure deliverability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate GitLab&#39;s services value proposition, catalog offerings, and implementation methodologies in the context of customer requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain agreement on scope and price while guiding customers through commercial terms, procurement processes, and contracting structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project- and account-level escalations, ensuring rapid resolution and maintaining customer confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position consulting, training, success tiers, and additional solutions proactively to ensure successful outcomes and long-term customer retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate solutioning sessions including implementation roadmapping, enterprise strategy discussions, and executive-level requirements gathering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable outcomes by structuring services that support customer success metrics, accurately forecasting services bookings, and tracking key performance indicators related to bookings, margin, and attachment to strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the engagement lifecycle from initial discovery and pre-sales solutioning through scoping, SOW development, staffing alignment, and transition to delivery, ensuring engagements are deliverable, clearly defined, and outcome-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence cross-functional teams by articulating GitLab’s professional services value proposition in the context of federal requirements and compliance frameworks, and by feeding customer insights back into sales, delivery, and practice management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional sales and engagement leadership to prioritize and manage services opportunities that support critical deals and strategic initiatives, providing clear recommendations on risk management, negotiation strategies, and commercial structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of enablement and continuous improvement by training field teams on how to position and sell professional services by sharing trends, feedback, and suggestions that improve go-to-market content and operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated progressive experience structuring, scoping, and selling professional services engagements in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success operating in a pre-sales context, conducting discovery, designing outcome-oriented proposals, and developing custom statements of work (SOWs) and staffing plans for large, complex implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of software development lifecycle (SDLC), DevOps practices, and cloud transformation initiatives, with the ability to connect technical solutions to mission objectives and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and interpersonal skills with executive presence, able to build trusted advisor relationships with division chiefs, program managers, contracting stakeholders, and senior technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly developed facilitation, negotiation, and problem-solving skills, including the ability to guide customers through acquisition processes, commercial structures, and risk mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working cross-functionally with sales, solutions architecture, delivery, and operations teams to align on deal strategy, staffing, and successful execution in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity to work autonomously and asynchronously in a fully remote setting, managing multiple complex opportunities while maintaining accurate forecasting and consistent alignment with GitLab values and goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Professional Services Engagement Management team at GitLab is dedicated to designing and structuring services engagements that set our customers up for successful, long-term adoption of our DevSecOps platform. We build and manage strategic relationships with customers to understand their goals, surface their services needs, and translate complex transformation initiatives into clear, outcome-oriented engagement plans. Composed of experienced services, consulting, and delivery professionals distributed across multiple regions, we operate asynchronously to support field teams, shape implementation strategies, and guide customers through their services journey. We focus on creating scalable engagement models, fostering open communication with internal stakeholders, and adapting our services offerings to the evolving needs of a rapidly maturing organization and its customers. For more on how our team works, see the&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Professional Services Engagement Management handbook page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Demo Architect, you&#39;ll help GitLab teams and customers get hands-on with our platform faster and with less friction. This role reports to the Senior Director of our Solutions Architecture Center of Excellence, with day-to-day partnership from the current team lead. You&#39;ll build and improve the tools, applications, and infrastructure that support field team demos, workshops, trials, and internal test environments across the field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What makes this role unique is its mix of software engineering, infrastructure, and customer-facing collaboration. You&#39;ll work like an engineer for much of the role, while also partnering with Solutions Architects, Account Executives, Customer Success, and others to make sure what we build is practical, usable, and aligned to how the field sells.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain tools, applications, and workflows that support demos, workshops, trials, and internal test environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand the Demo Architect Portal to improve automation, self-service, and scalability for field teams and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provision and support infrastructure that enables hands-on customer experiences across&lt;a href=&quot;https://gitlab.com&quot;&gt; GitLab.com&lt;/a&gt;, demo instances, and internal environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Solutions Architects, Account Executives, Customer Success, Marketing, Revenue Operations, UX, and Engineering to understand needs and deliver practical technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and document go-to-market workflows (e.g., how teams run demos/workshops/trials) and automate the steps that waste time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create technical workshop assets and enablement content that support pre-sales and technical selling for individual contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on sales opportunities when specialized technical demo support or custom solutions are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the presenter experience by reducing manual setup work and making demo workflows easier to use and repeat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal teams that rely on demo or test infrastructure, helping keep those environments available and useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot urgent demo/workshop environment issues under pressure and communicate status clearly to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building software, systems, or internal tools that support technical users or business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deliver production-grade software and automation with attention to reliability, maintainability, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across application development and infrastructure, with comfort navigating provisioning, automation, and service workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with monitoring/observability tools to shorten investigation time when something breaks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort communicating and collaborating with technical and non-technical stakeholders across Sales, Solutions Architecture, Customer Success, Marketing, UX, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to design and iterate on solutions for usability and repeatability, not just technical correctness, with awareness that the end user may be a seller or Solutions Architect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently in a remote, asynchronous environment, with willingness to travel periodically for team offsites and occasional in-person planning/whiteboarding sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to technical demos, workshops, trials, or enablement assets, and/or interest in learning the pre-sales context; transferable experience from software engineering, site reliability engineering, systems engineering, solutions architecture, or similar technical paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the Demo Architect team at GitLab, we support the field’s demo, workshop, and trial experiences by maintaining shared tooling and the infrastructure behind internal demo and test instances used across GitLab. We’re a small, globally distributed group that collaborates asynchronously across regions and adapts quickly to changing needs, with a current focus on scaling automation, enabling more self-service, extending support to partners, and maintaining reliable internal infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

At Flix, we offer a dynamic work environment with competitive pay, strong growth opportunities, and a tech-driven approach to making travel more accessible, sustainable, and affordable. &nbsp;
As Senior/Expert HR Tech Solution Architect, you will join the People &amp; Organization Digital Transformation team to help shape and transform Flix's global HR technology landscape.
 Together with FlixTech, you will support the architecture, integration landscape and governance framework across a complex, multi-entity and multi-country organization — ensuring our technology enables Flix's future HR target operating model. The role reports to the Head of Digital Transformation and works closely with the People Enablement Tech stream, FlixTech, IT Security, Data Privacy and HR teams globally.
 You will help set the technical and architectural direction that the wider team — including our AI &amp; Automation Engineers and HR Tech Business Analysts — builds within. 
This role is based in Berlin, given the global scope, regular collaboration with colleagues across European, APAC and US time zones is required. &nbsp;
About the Role

Work closely with FlixTech, shape Flix's target HR technology architecture across core HRIS, payroll, time &amp; attendance, talent, recruiting, document management and surrounding enterprise systems — ensuring the architecture enables our HR target operating and service-delivery model by connecting processes, roles, systems and service tiers while balancing global standards with local requirements.
Drive global HRIS transformation initiatives, from major platform revamps and redesigns to potential HRIS migrations — evaluating technology options, building business cases, structuring programs through project plans and RAID/risk frameworks, and driving execution through solution design, integrations, testing, cutover, parallel runs and stabilization.
Define HR technology integrations and data flows between the HRIS and surrounding enterprise systems — determining what data moves between systems and through which integration patterns, including REST APIs, OAuth 2.0, webhooks, SFTP, middleware and event-driven architectures.
Establish and evolve HR technology governance and control frameworks, including system ownership and RACI, security and role-model design, least privilege and segregation of duties, audit trails, change/release governance, internal controls and data privacy aligned with GDPR and audit/IPO-readiness expectations.
Act as the bridge between HR functional and technology teams, translating business and process requirements into target-state solutions and executable designs, and driving global HR technology implementation projects from requirements through go-live.

About You

6+ years of experience in HR technology transformation, HRIS, solution architecture, enterprise architecture or HRIS delivery, with a degree in Information Systems, Computer Science, Business Technology or a related field.
Strong HR domain and Workday expertise, with an understanding of how core HRIS, payroll, time &amp; attendance, talent, recruiting and surrounding enterprise systems work together across a global HR technology landscape. Any Workday certifications would be an advantage.
Demonstrable experience driving Workday transformations, including major Workday redesigns, platform revamps and/or migrations end to end. Hands-on enterprise Workday experience across configuration, integration or migration is a strong differentiator.
Strong integration and systems architecture knowledge, including REST APIs, OAuth 2.0, webhooks, SFTP, middleware, data flows and event-driven architectures across complex enterprise environments.
Experience supporting the design of HR target operating models, HR service-delivery models and technology governance frameworks, including security and role models, segregation of duties, audit trails, internal controls and data privacy in regulated, multi-country environments.
Experience with cloud architecture and AI &amp; automation technologies is critical, including areas such as Claude/GenAI deployment, MCPs, n8n and Rovo Agents, alongside strong Jira project-management capabilities.
Fluency in English. Certifications in solution/enterprise architecture, project management, agile or automation (e.g. TOGAF, PMP, SAFe, Scrum, Six Sigma, n8n) are a plus.

We recognize that everyone carries a unique set of valuable skills and experiences. If you think you could have an impact even though you don't meet 100% of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply. We want to hear from you! &nbsp;
What We Offer

Travel perks: 12 free Flix vouchers + 12 discount vouchers for friends &amp; family.&nbsp;
Work from (M)Anywhere: Depending on your role, work from another location for up to 60 days per year.&nbsp;
Hybrid work model: We are an office-first company, but we offer flexibility to balance work and life.&nbsp;
Wellbeing support: Access confidential 1:1 counselling, courses, and stress management for yourself and up to four family members.&nbsp;
Learning &amp; Development: Take advantage of language classes, training courses, and expert-led sessions to grow your skills.&nbsp;
Mentoring Program: Connect with experienced colleagues to gain insights and accelerate your career.&nbsp;

To view more local benefits specific to each office location, please check out this link:&nbsp;Locations - Flix Career

Why Join Flix?
At Flix, you'll find teams that rally together to overcome challenges and spark creativity. We believe in ownership culture - giving you the freedom to take initiative, make an impact, and shape your own career path.As we continue to expand across the globe, you can make a real difference in how we work.
If you're ready to grow and lead your journey, Flix is the place for you!&nbsp;

&nbsp;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A career driven by you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring two senior software engineers for Autonex Tech Effectiveness (ATE), a team within Core Tech working across business units. We build software that helps engineering teams deliver more effectively and make better use of their resources. Our remit spans cloud and AI spending, software licensing, delivery insights, and the workflows that connect them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll build AI agents, integrations, and internal products that turn data into useful decisions and actions. You’ll work closely with engineers, engineering leaders, and Finance to understand real problems, ship solutions, and measure their impact. We’re looking for a strong software engineer who is excited about agentic AI and cares about how engineering organizations work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See what this looks like in practice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.autoscout24.com/blog/posts/ai-teammates-nex-and-fyn/&quot;&gt;AI Teammates for Scrum and FinOps: How AutoScout24 Built Nex and Fyn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve AI products such as Nex and Fyn, their companion tools, and self-service analytics for engineering effectiveness and FinOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design agentic workflows with tool calling, orchestration, retrieval, and memory. Make their actions predictable through clear permissions, human approvals, and auditable execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect engineering and financial data through APIs and reliable data pipelines, integrating with tools such as Slack, Jira, our developer portal, and cloud and AI providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build FinOps capabilities for cost attribution, forecasting, anomaly detection, and optimization across cloud, AI, and software spend. Keep financial calculations accurate and traceable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve delivery visibility and reduce administrative toil, waiting time, and workflow friction. Help teams understand the balance between operational work and product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own products from discovery and design through deployment and operation. Build evaluations, tests, and observability that cover agent behavior, reliability, security, latency, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering teams, Finance, Procurement, and Employee Tech to prioritize useful improvements. Use adoption, user feedback, and measurable outcomes to guide what you build next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to succeed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior-level software engineering experience, typically 5+ years, building and operating production applications or services, with strong skills in design, testing, debugging, and maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building LLM-powered applications and agentic systems used in real workflows. You can explain the design decisions, failure modes, and trade-offs behind what you’ve built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coding skills in at least one language, ideally Python or TypeScript, and confidence working with APIs, data integrations, and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in AI and a habit of experimenting, learning, and shipping. Modern AI coding tools such as Claude Code or Codex are part of your day-to-day work, and you take responsibility for the result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience deploying and running software in AWS or a comparable cloud, including CI/CD and observability. You can make sensible choices about reliability, security, and operating cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in engineering effectiveness: developer experience, delivery flow, automation, and responsible use of resources. You want to understand whether a tool improves someone’s work and how to measure that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication, product thinking, and ownership. You can turn an ambiguous problem into a practical solution and work with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience that would help&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FinOps, cloud cost optimization, engineering analytics, developer experience, or engineering operations. Curiosity and willingness to learn these domains matter too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agent frameworks, MCP integrations, Amazon Bedrock, or AgentCore. Our current agents use the Strands Agents SDK; experience with other stacks is welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building internal tools, dashboards, or data products that people use to make decisions, and using metrics carefully in their context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why this team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a small team that uses AI throughout its own work and builds products for colleagues across the business. You’ll have ownership of meaningful problems and room to shape the solutions. Success means tools people trust and use, less time lost to friction, and better decisions about engineering investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AutoScout24 Group, we value diverse perspectives and an inclusive, respectful working environment. If you’re excited to build agentic AI products that improve how engineering works, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A career driven by you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Fullstack Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to build and evolve products for our dealer customers. You’ll work primarily with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;React, TypeScript and Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;, with a stronger focus on frontend development while contributing across the full stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring strong engineering fundamentals, sound technical judgement and the ability to take ownership of features in a complex, established product environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside building customer-facing AI capabilities, you’ll use&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI tools in your everyday development work&lt;/strong&gt;. We value curiosity and a willingness to learn; your depth as a software engineer is the foundation, and we’ll support you in developing your AI skills further.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join one of our product engineering teams and build products used by our dealer customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and evolve customer-facing applications using&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;React, TypeScript and Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;, with a stronger focus on frontend development while contributing across the full stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of features throughout the full development lifecycle — from technical design and implementation to testing, deployment and operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within large, established codebases and continuously improve their quality, maintainability and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design and other engineers to turn customer and business needs into pragmatic technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use GenAI development tools to support activities such as coding, debugging, refactoring, testing and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply sound engineering judgement when using AI-generated solutions, validating outputs and ensuring that quality, security and maintainability remain high.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge, contribute to technical discussions and help continuously improve engineering practices within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;building and operating production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong professional experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;React, TypeScript and Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong frontend engineering experience combined with the ability and willingness to contribute across backend services when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;large, existing codebases&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and delivering maintainable, well-tested software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of software engineering fundamentals, including application architecture, testing, code quality and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking ownership of features or technical solutions from design through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make pragmatic technical decisions and clearly explain the reasoning and trade-offs behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating effectively with Product, Design and Engineering colleagues in cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI and AI-assisted software development&lt;/strong&gt;, with an interest in incorporating these tools into your everyday engineering workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A learning mindset and the ability to quickly pick up new technologies and tools. Willingness to learn Java and contribute to Java-based backend services as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to collaborate, challenge ideas constructively and contribute to technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing backend services with Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using AI-assisted development tools such as GitHub Copilot, ChatGPT, Cursor, Claude or Codex.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building features or applications that integrate&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;LLMs or AI APIs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud environments such as&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience building products or tools for B2B customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Design Director - Patient (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib is a mission-driven healthcare technology company, founded in Paris in 2013. Today, nearly &lt;strong&gt;3,000 people&lt;/strong&gt; work across Europe to transform the way healthcare is delivered and experienced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than &lt;strong&gt;500,000 healthcare professionals&lt;/strong&gt; use Doctolib’s solutions, and the patient app is used by approximately &lt;strong&gt;90 million people&lt;/strong&gt; across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For patients, Doctolib began as a simple way to find a healthcare professional and book an appointment. We are now building something much more ambitious: an &lt;strong&gt;AI-powered Health Companion&lt;/strong&gt; that helps people navigate care, understand their health and take the right next step throughout their health journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This means moving beyond a primarily transactional product towards an experience that supports patients before, during and after care, through access to care, health information, patient data, messaging, recommendations, care plans and AI-powered assistance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Product Design Director to help define what this next generation of patient experience should look and feel like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will build and lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Product Design Director, Patient&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the design vision and quality bar for Doctolib’s patient experience. You will report to our VP Design and work closely with the Product, Engineering, Medical, Data and Business leadership teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your scope will cover the full patient journey, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;access to care, search and booking;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;patient messaging and teleconsultation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;the Patient Health Record and patient context;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;the app homepage and daily health experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;health content and prevention;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;recommendations, reminders and care plans;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;new patient services and subscription experiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;conversational and AI-powered experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The current team includes &lt;strong&gt;six Senior Product Designers and one Senior Content Designer&lt;/strong&gt;. You will lead, coach and develop this team while shaping the organisation and operating model needed to support the next phase of the Patient product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mandate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the design vision for the Patient stream, from a high-traffic booking experience to a trusted Health Companion used throughout the health journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge two equally important challenges: continuing to improve the core access-to-care experience while creating new reasons for patients to return beyond booking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar for product design, interaction design and content across the patient experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close enough to the product and the craft to make high-quality design decisions, not only set direction from a distance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape AI-native experiences that are clear, useful and trustworthy, including recommendations, conversational interfaces and next-best actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong design principles for transparency, explainability, uncertainty, user control and safe escalation in a healthcare context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-performing design organisation, including hiring, coaching, talent development and second-line leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create effective ways of working across Design, Product, Engineering, Medical, Data and Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help scale a coherent experience across countries, languages and different healthcare contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect design decisions to user behaviour, product outcomes and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;established a clear and compelling design vision for the Patient stream;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;raised the quality bar across both core access-to-care journeys and newer Health Companion experiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;helped define a coherent interaction model for AI-powered patient experiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;strengthened collaboration between Design, Product, Engineering and Medical;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;developed a clear operating model and growth plan for the Patient Design organisation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;helped Doctolib increase the value and relevance of the patient experience beyond appointment booking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are likely to bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading Product Design, 10+ years in product design including 3+ years in people leadership..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a consumer product organisation, ideally one used by millions of people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing and scaling products across multiple markets, with an understanding of localisation, cultural differences and the balance between global consistency and local relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing at least five Product Designers, ideally a larger organisation including senior individual contributors and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product design craft and creative judgement. You can recognise excellent work, make difficult quality trade-offs and stay close enough to the details to raise the standard of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience connecting design choices to measurable outcomes such as adoption, conversion, engagement, retention, satisfaction or user behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong and practical understanding of AI-native product experiences. You have thought deeply about how AI changes interaction design, user expectations, trust, transparency and control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing with uncertainty, recommendations, personalisation or conversational interfaces is highly relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to operate across complex products and stakeholders, while maintaining clarity and momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A concise and compelling communication style. You can articulate a clear point of view, align senior stakeholders and inspire teams to move in a new direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in healthcare or another regulated, trust-sensitive environment is valuable, but healthcare experience is not required. What matters is your respect for domain expertise and your ability to design responsibly in high-stakes contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English. French or German would be a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working style aligned with the Doctolib Playbook: User First, Medical Expertise, Forefront of Innovation, Bold, Drive, Passion, Humility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Doctolib, why now?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib gives you the opportunity to work on a consumer product with significant reach, strong European scale and a mission that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The patient product already has a large and engaged audience. The next challenge is to make the experience more useful, more contextual and more present in people’s everyday health journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join at a defining moment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Doctolib is moving from appointment booking towards continuous health support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is becoming a core part of the product experience, not an isolated feature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Patient Design organisation is being strengthened and reshaped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The product must work across multiple European countries, languages and healthcare systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The design foundations for the next chapter are still being built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to shape a new category at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;consumer product design, healthcare and AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and to define how people will discover, understand and manage their health in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib is an equal opportunity employer. We believe diverse teams build better products and improve healthcare for more people. We welcome applications regardless of gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability or place of origin. If you have a disability, please let us know how we can make the recruitment process more accessible.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Information submitted through this application is processed by Doctolib for recruitment purposes. For more information about data processing and your rights, please refer to our privacy policies:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Germany&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Italy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Netherlands&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For questions about data privacy, please contact -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Wir suchen Dich als &lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Packaging Senior Lead (x/f/m) &lt;/strong&gt;für unser Revenue Operations Team in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib bietet Arztpraxen in Deutschland ein Portfolio, das von Terminmanagement und Patientenkommunikation über KI-Assistenten für Telefon und Dokumentation bis zur vollständigen Praxissoftware reicht, vertrieben über Field Sales, Inside Sales, Customer Success und Partner. Du verantwortest die Preis- und Paketarchitektur dieses Portfolios: wie wir Preise differenzieren, was ein Einstiegspaket leisten muss, wie unsere Bundles aufgebaut sind und nach welcher Logik wir abrechnen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die Rolle verbindet Strategie und Umsetzung. Du entwickelst Preisentscheidungen auf Basis von Zahlungsbereitschaft, Wettbewerb und Unit Economics, vertrittst sie gegenüber dem Leadership und sorgst dafür, dass sie im Markt so ankommen, wie sie gedacht sind: im Angebot der Seller:innen, in den Rabattregeln und im realisierten Preis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nach sechs Monaten hast Du unsere Paketarchitektur auf den Prüfstand gestellt und die nächsten Schritte mit dem Leadership entschieden, eine erste Preis- oder Paketänderung umgesetzt und eine belastbare Sicht darauf aufgebaut, welcher Preis nach Rabatten tatsächlich realisiert wird.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paketarchitektur:&lt;/strong&gt; Du entwickelst unsere Paketstruktur vom Einstiegspaket bis zum Komplettangebot weiter und legst fest, welche Produkte und Leistungen wo liegen, wie sich die Stufen voneinander abgrenzen und welche Zusatzoptionen sie ergänzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preislogik und Differenzierung: &lt;/strong&gt;Du definierst, worauf sich ein Preis bezieht, etwa pro Behandler:in, pro Praxis oder nach Nutzung, und wie wir nach Fachrichtung, Praxisgröße oder Vertragslaufzeit differenzieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidenz und Business Cases:&lt;/strong&gt; Du misst Zahlungsbereitschaft, analysierst Preiselastizität, Conversion und Churn nach Segment, beobachtest den Wettbewerb und rechnest mit Finance die Umsatz- und Margenwirkung jeder Option durch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preisänderungen im Markt:&lt;/strong&gt; Du planst Preisanpassungen und Paketwechsel für Neu- und Bestandskund:innen, inklusive Migrationslogik und Kommunikation, und begleitest sie bis in alle Sales Motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatt-Governance und Deal Desk:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verantwortest Rabattregeln, Freigabelogik und Sonderkonditionen und machst transparent, wie viel vom Listenpreis tatsächlich realisiert wird&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Du bist der festen Überzeugung, dass Du genau das mitbringst, was es für die Position braucht? Dann ermutigen wir Dich, Dich zu bewerben. Selbst wenn Du nicht jede Anforderung erfüllst, bist Du vielleicht genau die/der richtige zukünftige Doctoliber:in für diese oder andere Stellen!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Um Teil unseres Teams zu werden, bringst Du Folgendes mit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast mehrere Jahre Pricing und Packaging in B2B-SaaS oder einem anderen Subscription-Geschäft gestaltet, im Unternehmen oder in der Pricing-Beratung, und Preis- oder Paketänderungen bis in den Markt gebracht&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du weißt, wie man Zahlungsbereitschaft herausfindet, aus Kundengesprächen, Umfragen, Preistests im Markt und Daten zu Abschlüssen, Nutzung und Churn, und baust Deine Preis- und Margenmodelle selbst, in Spreadsheets und SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übersetzt Analysen in klare Empfehlungen zu Preismetrik, Paketgrenzen und Preisniveau und vertrittst sie vor Senior Leadership und Sales Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du setzt KI routiniert in Analyse und Arbeitsabläufen ein, z.B. für Wettbewerbs-Monitoring oder die Auswertung von Deal-Anfragen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du sprichst verhandlungssicher Deutsch und fließend Englisch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Besonders interessant sind für uns außerdem:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im Gesundheitswesen, mit Health-Tech oder in einem anderen regulierten Markt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit nutzungsbasierten Preismodellen, Self-Service-Buchung oder Testphasen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit Rabatt-Governance, einem Deal Desk oder CPQ-Systemen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir Dir bieten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein von Doctolib gesponsertes Deutschlandticket, wenn Du aus dem Büro oder im Hybridmodus arbeitest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 Urlaubstage + 1 Tag zusätzlich für jedes volle Beschäftigungs-Kalenderjahr (max. 30 Tage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Möglichkeit, 10 Tage im Jahr aus dem Ausland zu arbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine betriebliche Krankenzusatzversicherung mit individuellen Zusatzleistungen (u.a. Zahnreinigung u.v.m.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge (bAV) mit einem Arbeitgeberzuschuss von 40 % (15 % während der Probezeit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teilnahme an Doctolibs langfristigem Mitarbeiterbeteiligungsprogramm DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Das Doctolib Parent Care Programm, das extra Elternzeit (1 Monat) u.v.m. enthält&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kostenlose Mental Health- und Coaching-Sessions über einen externen Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zusätzlich zu gesunden Snacks und einem regelmäßigen Frühstücksbuffet, bieten wir Essensgutscheine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein gefördertes Sportangebot mit unserem Partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Für pflegende Betreuungspersonen und Beschäftigte mit Behinderungen gibt es ein Angebot, das flexiblere Arbeitszeiten, zusätzliche Freistellung aus medizinischen Gründen und psychologische Unterstützung beinhaltet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Der Interviewprozess&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview mit Deiner TA Partnerin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview mit Deiner Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case Study Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Festanstellung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vollzeit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbeitsort: Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybride Arbeitsweise (3 Tage Office/Woche)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startdatum: ab sofort&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir verfolgen die Vision, die Gesundheit aller zu verbessern. Dies spiegelt sich auch im Recruiting wider. Wir evaluieren Bewerbungen ausschließlich auf der Grundlage von Qualifikation und Motivation. Diskriminierung wird bei uns nicht toleriert.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Je diverser unser Team und die Ideen sind, desto mehr wird unser Produkt die Gesundheit unserer Nutzer:innen verbessern können. Deshalb laden wir Dich ein, Dich bei uns zu bewerben, unabhängig von Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, ethnischer Herkunft oder Behinderung.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Um Chancengleichheit zu gewährleisten, kannst Du in Deiner Bewerbung auf Angaben wie Fotos, Alter, etc. verzichten. Lass uns bitte wissen, welche Vorkehrungen wir treffen können, um Dich bestmöglich zu unterstützen. Wir freuen uns, mit Dir das Gesundheitswesen zu digitalisieren!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alle bereitgestellten Informationen werden von Doctolib für das Bewerbungsmanagement verarbeitet. Für Details zur Datenverarbeitung klicke bitte&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; hier&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bei Fragen oder wenn Du Deine Rechte wahrnehmen möchtest, wende Dich bitte an hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-DC2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us as a (Senior) Full Stack Developer - Web (f/m/d) in Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Story&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Developer (Web Platform)&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape and scale thinkcell’s web platform and enable multiple teams to efficiently manage and publish content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role for someone who only wants to work within a fixed web stack or maintain existing templates. We are looking for a web engineer who enjoys solving complex technical problems, making sound architectural decisions, and building systems that remain robust and maintainable as requirements evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across frontend and backend, improve the technical foundation of our web platform, and help us build scalable solutions that enable our teams to manage and publish content. Along the way, you will collaborate closely with stakeholders across design, marketing, product and engineering but with strong ownership over technical quality, long-term maintainability, and the overall direction of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and evolve our web platform features across front-end and CMS back-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex technical problems in a pragmatic way, balancing speed of delivery with long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural improvements that make our web ecosystem more robust, scalable, and easier to work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve our back-end functionality in PHP and Laravel for integrations, dynamic features, and internal tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and optimize our CMS and publishing workflows to support efficient content operations without compromising technical quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve performance, Core Web Vitals, accessibility, and technical SEO foundations across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on the evolution of our current web architecture, while also challenging existing approaches when better solutions exist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design, marketing, product, and engineering teams to turn business requirements into well-structured technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with back-end systems written in C++, ensuring reliable and efficient data exchange across system boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve developer experience, reduce complexity, and raise the overall engineering standard of the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of technical tasks and help define best practices for modern web development at think-cell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building and shipping production-grade web platforms, applications, or systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to solve non-trivial technical problems and work confidently in complex web related codebases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full stack engineering skills, with solid backend experience in PHP, Laravel, or similar technologies and a frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong frontend fundamentals, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript and modern approaches to building maintainable user interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgment when making architectural and technical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic mindset: you know when to build for flexibility and when to keep things simple&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and confidence to work with unfamiliar technologies or domains when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of ownership and responsibility for code quality, maintainability, and technical outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating across disciplines and communicating clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Statamic CMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with static site generation challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Deployment Tools such as Jenkins or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Tailwind, Alpine.js, or similar frontend tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving performance-critical, SEO-relevant, or content-heavy platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python for automation or tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating with non-web backend systems or services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Thinking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We embrace change and challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We take pride in our work and learn from our mistakes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer First&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We prioritize delivering lasting value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unified Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We foster collaboration, respect, and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strive for Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We set ambitious goals and pursue quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why is thinkcell the right place for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower over 1.3 million users across 35,000 companies, including top consulting firms and major global enterprises. With offices in Berlin, Munich, Denver, Boston, London, Tokyo, and Dubai, we’re a diverse team of over 220 people, committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;think-cell is more than a job – it&#39;s a chance to be part of an innovative, inclusive team that values collaboration and growth. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. Together, we can shape the future of productivity software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We can’t wait to see what you’ll bring to the team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;OUR MISSION&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Redwood, we empower our customers with lights-out automation for their mission-critical business processes.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redwood Software is the leading orchestration platform for the autonomous enterprise, driving business transformation at the lowest total cost of ownership. Redwood empowers organizations to intelligently automate and orchestrate mission-critical business and IT processes across complex ERP, hybrid cloud, data and emerging agentic AI systems. Through its SaaS-first automation fabric—with AI embedded across the automation lifecycle—Redwood accelerates the path to autonomous operations. Backed by 30 years of experience and trusted by more than 50% of the Fortune 50, Redwood helps organizations unlock human potential to focus on innovation, growth and what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;CORE VALUES&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One Team. One Redwood&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make Your Own Weather&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Obsess over Customer Success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work the Problem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be Curious&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the Outcome&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Respect Each Other&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gartner predicts that by 2029, 90% of organizations currently delivering workload automation will have transitioned to Service Orchestration and Automation Platforms (SOAPs) — a market expected to reach $4.9 billion by 2028. Redwood is the top-ranked vendor in Gartner&#39;s 2025 Critical Capabilities for SOAP, scoring #1 across all five use cases. We&#39;re expanding our Solutions Engineering team to meet that demand. In this role, you&#39;ll be the technical face of a category leader — helping enterprise prospects understand not just what Redwood does, but why it&#39;s the right answer in a market that&#39;s fundamentally changing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cover the full SOAP surface area.&lt;/strong&gt; Present and position Redwood&#39;s capabilities across all five Gartner-defined SOAP use cases — IT workload automation, IT workflow orchestration, data orchestration, citizen/self-service automation, and DevOps automation. You won&#39;t be a deep expert in all five on day one, but you&#39;ll develop enough fluency to lead discovery and qualify the right fit for each prospect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrate Redwood&#39;s platform with AI fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver compelling technical presentations and live product overviews that connect Redwood&#39;s AI capabilities — AI-powered observability, intelligent job scheduling, and agentic orchestration — to concrete operational outcomes, not just platform features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI tools as a force multiplier.&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage LLM-based research, prompt-driven workflows, and AI productivity tooling as a standard part of how you work — accelerating demo preparation, account research, competitive analysis, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position confidently in a competitive market.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop a working understanding of the SOAP competitive landscape well enough to articulate Redwood&#39;s differentiation, handle objections live, and understand why you win and why you lose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical evaluations hands-on.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead proof-of-concept work with prospects to validate use cases and prove out business outcomes — including light scripting (REST APIs, Python, bash) where needed to close technical gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable Account Executives.&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical insight, SOAP market context, and prospect feedback that sharpens messaging and accelerates new account acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay ahead of the SOAP and AI landscape.&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously deepen your understanding of how the market is evolving — from agentic AI and GenAI-powered automation to data pipeline orchestration and self-service automation — and bring that context into every prospect conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uphold Redwood&#39;s standards.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain the highest ethical standards across all customer-facing work, representing the company with professionalism and technical credibility at every level of the prospect organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for in how you work:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resourceful:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re constantly curious, proactively learning new AI tools and technical capabilities as part of how you operate — not as a side project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring initiative, confidence, and a results-oriented mindset to every pursuit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goal-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; You set meaningful objectives, track them rigorously, and hold yourself accountable to outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re organized and exercise sound judgment — able to manage multiple technical evaluations and sales cycles simultaneously without things falling through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain SOAP, AI, and automation concepts clearly to both a VP of Engineering and a CFO, and you know the difference matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable shifting priorities and handling complex, dynamic requirements in a fast-moving enterprise sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;YOUR EXPERIENCE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The most important thing we&#39;re hiring for is technical aptitude and intellectual curiosity. Domain knowledge can be taught — the ability to learn fast, think technically, and communicate clearly cannot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we require:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years in a pre-sales, solutions engineering, or adjacent technical role&lt;/strong&gt; in enterprise software — Process Automation, ERP, Data Integration, Business Intelligence, ESB, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical aptitude.&lt;/strong&gt; Working knowledge of REST APIs and comfort with light scripting (Python, bash, or equivalent) sufficient to build simple integrations, validate technical scenarios, or debug issues in a demo environment. You don&#39;t need to be a software engineer — but you need to be comfortable in that world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated, hands-on use of AI tools in a professional context&lt;/strong&gt; — LLMs, prompt-based workflows, AI-assisted research, AI productivity tooling. This is a baseline requirement, not a differentiator. Bonus if you understand how AI capabilities like observability, intelligent automation, and agentic orchestration are being embedded into enterprise automation platforms specifically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with agentic AI and AI orchestration concepts.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand what multi-agent systems are, how LLMs are being embedded into enterprise workflows, and can hold a substantive conversation with technical buyers about where this is headed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-level ERP literacy&lt;/strong&gt; across core business processes: Financials, Procure to Pay, Plan to Build, Quote to Cash, Reporting, and Data Quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to bridge technical depth and business value&lt;/strong&gt; — credible in a room with enterprise architects, while equally effective communicating ROI to executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/strong&gt; from an accredited college or university.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A head start — not a hard filter. We&#39;ll invest in the rest:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to workload automation, job scheduling, or enterprise orchestration platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SAP environments — S/4HANA, RISE with SAP, SAP BTP, or core SAP business processes. We operate deeply in this ecosystem and will develop this knowledge in you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of data orchestration concepts — ETL/ELT pipelines, DataOps workflows, data movement across hybrid environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with DevOps toolchains and how automation intersects with CI/CD, infrastructure provisioning, or SRE practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Customer Success, Technical Support, or Professional Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;css-1i27f3a&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-ey7qxc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1s1axh3&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;jobPostingDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you like growth and working with happy, enthusiastic over-achievers, you&#39;ll enjoy your career with us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE LEGAL BIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Redwood is an equal opportunity employer. Redwood prohibits unlawful discrimination based on race, colour, religion, sex, gender identity, marital or veteran status, age, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information or characteristics (or those of a family member), sexual orientation, pregnancy or any other consideration made unlawful by regional or local laws. We also prohibit discrimination based on a perception that anyone has any of those characteristics or is associated with a person who has or is perceived as having any of those characteristics. All such discrimination is unlawful and will have a zero tolerance policy applied to it.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redwood will comply with all local data protection laws, including GDPR when it comes to the handling and processing of personal data. Should you wish for us to remove your personal data from our recruitment database, please email us directly at -----
&lt;/div&gt;
